{"id": "14592", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14592", "title": "Ikipe", "text": "Ikipe y\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru ni uruganda,ikipe igizwe n\u2019inzego zitandukanye zuzuzanya, hazamo gukorana neza kandi kinyamwuga kuri buri mukozi uri muri izo nzego harimo abayobozi, abatoza, abakinnyi, abashinzwe umutungo, abategura amafunguro y\u2019abakinnyi, abakora isuku, abashinzwe umutekano, abashoferi niwo musaruro mubona mu kibuga no hanze yacyo mu makipe akomeye.\ninzego za ikipe.\nPeresida wa ikipe hagakurikiraho Inama y'ubutegetsi hagakurikiraho Ushinzwe ikipe (CEO) hakaza abashizwe umutungo, abashizwe ibya tekinike, abashizwe abakozi, abashizwe kumenyekanisha ibikorwa n;ubucuruzi.\nInyungu za ikipe\nAmafaranga ikipe ibona aturuka ahantu hatandukanye, haba abaterankunga, haba amafaranga ava ku bibuga, kugurisha uburenganzira bwo kwerekana amashusho y\u2019ikipe kuri television, kugurisha bimwe mubice bigize stade ku bafatanyabikorwa, kugurisha abakinnyi ahandi, umusanzu w\u2019abafa ni nkunga."}
{"id": "14593", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14593", "title": "Es mutunda wfc", "text": "Es mutunda wfc (Ecole Mutunda Women Football Club) \u00a0ni ikipe y\u2019umupira wa maguru wa babigize umwuga. Ni ikipe igaragaramo abagore n\u2019abakobwa mugukina shampiyona y\u2019igihugu I tegurwa na FERWAFA, Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru mu Rwanda ndetse n\u2019igikombe cy\u2019amahoro cy\u2019igihugu cyu Rwanda. Es mutunda wfc ikina mu shampiyona y\u2019icyiciro cya mbere cyu mu mupira w\u2019amaguru mu Rwanda mu bagore."}
