{"id": "14595", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14595", "title": "Apaer wfc", "text": "APAER WFC (Association des Parents Adventistes Pour l\u2019Education \u00e0 Rusororo, Women Football Club) rifite ishuri rya Rusororo Institute bashinze ishuri ryisumbuye ryigamo abanyeshuri basanzwe ndetse n'abakinnyi ba APAER Women Football Club, ikinwamo n\u2019abanyeshuri b\u2019abakobwa biga kuri iri shuri riherereye mu Murenge wa Rusororo mu Karere ka Gasabo. APAER WFC yazamutse mu shampiyona cyiciro cya mbere mu mwaka w\u2019imikino wa 2021-2022 imaze umwaka umwe mu shampiyona yi cyiciro cya kabili. Urugendo rw' Ikipe ya APAER WFC muri ruhago y\u2019abagore y\u2019u Rwanda yarutangira mu 1999. APAER WFC ikina shampiyona y\u2019igihugu I tegurwa na FERWAFA, Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru mu Rwanda ndetse n\u2019igikombe cy\u2019amahoro cy\u2019igihugu cyu Rwanda. Aho mu mwaka w'imikino wa 2024-2025 ubuyobozi bwa Police WFC bwagiranye amasezerano y'imikoranire n'ubuyobozi bwa APAER WFC mugihe cy'umwaka umwe yo kwitwa POLICE WFC bakaba batitwa APAER WFC muri icyo gihe cy'amasezerano. \nAmashakiro.\nUbuyobozi bwa APAER WFC"}
{"id": "14596", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14596", "title": "Freedom wfc", "text": "Freedom wfc (Freedom Women Football Club) yashinzwe mu 2013, ikinira ku kibuga cya Nemba, mu Murenge wa Nemba \u00a0mu karere ka Gakenke, ni ikipe y\u2019umupira w' amaguru w'ababigize umwuga. Ni ikipe igaragaramo abagore n\u2019abakobwa mugukina shampiyona y\u2019igihugu Itegurwa na FERWAFA, Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru mu Rwanda ndetse n\u2019igikombe cy\u2019amahoro cy\u2019igihugu. Freedom wfc ikina mu shampiyona y\u2019icyiciro cya Kabiri cy'umupira w\u2019amaguru mu Rwanda mu bagore. "}
{"id": "14597", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14597", "title": "IPM wfc", "text": "IPM wfc (Institut Paroissiale de Mukarange, Women Football Club) \u00a0ni ikipe y\u2019umupira wa maguru wa babigize umwuga. Ni ikipe igaragaramo abagore n\u2019abakobwa mugukina shampiyona y\u2019igihugu I tegurwa na FERWAFA, Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira w\u2019amaguru mu Rwanda ndetse n\u2019igikombe cy\u2019amahoro cy\u2019igihugu. IPM wfc ikina mu shampiyona y\u2019icyiciro cya mbere cyu mu mupira w\u2019amaguru mu Rwanda mu bagore, ikaba yaratweye irushanwa rya Amashuri Kagame Cup ndetse, IPM WFC yatwaye igikombe cya Shampiyona y'ikiciro cya kabiri mu bagore muri 2022 kugeza 2023. "}
{"id": "14598", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14598", "title": "Comb duck", "text": "Comb duck ni inyoni idasanzwe, iboneka mu bishanga byo mu turere dushyuha two ku mugabane wa Amerika y'epfo mu majyepfo kugera mu karere k'umugezi wa Paraguay mu burasirazuba bwa Paraguay, mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba bwa Berezile no mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bwa Arijantine, kandi nk'inzererezi kuri Trinidad.\nImiterere.\nUbu bwoko busanzwe ntibushidikanywaho. Ni bumwe mu bwoko bunini bw'inyoni. Uburebure bushobora kuva 56 to 76\u00a0cm (22 kugeza 30\u00a0muri), amababa ari hagati ya 116 to 145\u00a0cm (46 kugeza 57\u00a0muri) n'uburemere kuva 1.03 to 2.9\u00a0kg (2.3 kugeza 6.4\u00a0lb). inyoni nkuru zifite umutwe wera wuzuyeho ibibara byijimye, nijosi ryera ryera hamwe na underparts. Ibice byo hejuru ni ubururu bwirabura-umukara hejuru, hamwe nubururu nicyatsi kibisi cyane cyane kumasegonda (amababa yo hepfo)."}
{"id": "14599", "revid": "10821", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14599", "title": "Moscovy duck", "text": "Moscovy Duck.\nMoscovy duck ni inyoni nini ikomoka muri america mu biyaga bya Rio Grand, Texas na mexico\nni imwe mu bwoko bw'inyoni nini ingana na 76 cm muburebure kandi igapima kugeza kubiro \n7 (15 lb.) izi nyoni ziganjemo umukara n' umweru zikagira kandi amababa yumukara umurika kubigabo\nnaho kubigore ukaba umukara wijimye, ingano yo kwererana kumutwe no kw' ijosi irahinduka bitewe \nninyoni iyo ariyo ishobora kuba umuhondo, umutuku, umukara cyangwa imvange iyo ariyo yose "}
{"id": "14600", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14600", "title": "Bearded vulture", "text": "BEARDED VULTURE ni inyoni nini cyane ihiga kandi ni umwe mu bagize ubwoko bwa \"Gypaetus\". Ubusanzwe bifatwa nkigisimba cyisi ya Kera, mubyukuri kigizwe numurongo muto muto wa Accipitridae hamwe nigisimba cyo muri Egiputa (\"Neophron percnopterus\"), mwene wabo wa hafi. Ntabwo ifitanye isano rya bugufi n\u2019ibisimba byo mu Isi Kera bikwiriye kuruta, urugero, inyoni, kandi itandukanye niyambere nijosi ryayo. Nubwo bidasa, ibisiga byo mu Misiri n'ubwanwa buri kimwe gifite umurizo umeze nka lozenge - kidasanzwe mu nyoni zihiga. Irazwi cyane nka \"Homa\", inyoni yimana mumigani ya Irani. "}
{"id": "14601", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14601", "title": "Secretary bird", "text": "secretary bird.\nsecretary bird ni ubwoko bw' bwinyoni bukunze kuboneka muri Africa ahantu hari ibyatsi byinshi cyane cyane munsi y' ubutayu bwa Sahara\nsecretary bird igaragara nk' inyoni ndede ifite umugongo ujya kumera nkuw'igisiga n'amaguru maremare ameze nkay' ikiyongoyongo\nariyo atuma iyi nyoni ishobora kugira uburebure bushobora kugera kuri metero imwe na santimetero 3 (1.3m), \nmuri ubu bwoko bw'inyoni, ibigabo n' ibigore byose birasa, izi nyoni kandi zigira ibitsike birebire iyo zikuze. \nizi nyoni zikunze kubaka ibyari byazo kunsongero zibiti bifite amahwa kandi zikaba zitera amagi agera kuri atatu(3).\nubushakashatsi bwagaragaje ko ubu bwoko bugenda bugabanuka bitewe nihindagurika ry'imiturire kw'isi yacu."}
{"id": "14602", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14602", "title": "Lappet faced volture", "text": "Lappet faced volture (Torgos tracheliotos) ni inyoni yo mu Isi ya Kera ijyanye na gahunda y\u2019inyoni Accipitriformes, ikubiyemo na kagoma, inyenzi, ibisimba n'ibisiga. Numunyamuryango wenyine wubwoko bwa \"Torgos\". Ntabwo ifitanye isano rya bugufi n\u2019ibisimba bishya byisi bisa, kandi ntibisangiye kumva impumuro nziza ya bamwe mubagize iryo tsinda.\nIgisimba cyarebaga lappet cyahoze gifatwa nka monotypical, ariko ubu gitandukanijwe mubice bibiri. Ubwoko bwatoranijwe butuye muri Afrika. Ubwoko buto \"T. t. negevensis\", itandukanye cyane mubigaragara n'ibisiga byo muri Afurika (nkuko byasobanuwe haruguru) byanduye mu gice cy'Abarabu."}
{"id": "14603", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14603", "title": "Egyptian vulture", "text": "Egyptian Vulture.\nEgyptian vulture ni ubwoko bw' inyoni bukunze kwitwa kandi inkoko ya Farawo ikunze kugaragara mubice by' amajyaruguru ya africa\nkuzamuka zikageza no m' ubuhindi, izi nyoni zifite umwihariko wo kugira amababa ameze nk'umurizo \naya niyo ayifasha mukuba yaguruka ikazamuka mubushyuhe mugihe gishyushye cy' umunsi.\nmubitunga izi nyoni harimo guhiga utundi tunyamanswa duto cyane, kandi izi nyonyi zinatungwa no kurya amagi yizindi nyoni\nkandi zikaba zikoresha utubuye duto nkintwaro kugirango zibashe kuyamena ziyarye."}
{"id": "14604", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14604", "title": "Umuhati", "text": "Umuhati ni igiti kigera kuri m 15 z'uburebure, umubyimba wa cm 25-35 z'umurambararo ufite amashami menshi mu bushori shori, hamwe n'inkovu z'amababi zigaragara mu gihe gihagaze cyonyine. amababi ya cyo arabyibushye kandi ni manini, amababi agaragara cyane icyatsi kibisi cyaka iyo amurutseho izuba, cyanga akagaragara nkama babi yi rose, imeze nkinkota, ifashe kugeza kuri cm 130 zu burebure ndetse na cm 16 z'ubugari. Umuhati ugaragara neza iyo utondeka neza, indabyo nyinshi kugeza kuri cm 100 z'uburebure na cm 70-150 z'ubugari. indabyo za grenish z'umuhati yera kugeza kuri cm 1.5 z'uburebure imbuto imbuto zijimye zigera kuri cm 1,5 kugeza kuri 2 z'uburebure na 1.5. kugeza kuri cm 3 z'ubugari."}
{"id": "14605", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14605", "title": "White headed vulture", "text": "White headed vulture (Trigonoceps occipitalis) n'inyoni yi cyisi ya kera yo muri Afrika. Umubare w'inyoni wagabanutse cyane mu myaka yashize kubera kwangirika kw'imiturire no kuroga kw'ibisiga ku ntumbi. Inyoni wazimye nayo yari mu kirwa cya Flores cyo muri Indoneziya mu gihe cya Late Pleistocene, byerekana ko ubwoko bwakwirakwiriye kera. "}
{"id": "14606", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14606", "title": "Ruppels vulture", "text": "Ruppels Vulture.\nRuppels vulture ni ubwoko 'inyoni zikunze gusangwa mu gace ka sahara ndetse no muri aAfrica y' iburasirazuba\nikiturira mubyatsi, mumisozi no mumashyamba.\nizi nyoni zishobora kuguruka kumuvuduko wa kilomemetro 35 mwisaha(35 km/hr)\ngusa igashobora kuguruka hagati y'amasaha 6-7 kumuns\ni kandi ikaguruka gusa ahantu hatarenze kilometero 150 kumunsi(150 km)."}
{"id": "14607", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14607", "title": "White backed vulture", "text": "White backed vulture(Gyps africanus) n'inyoni ya Kera mumuryango Accipitridae, kirimo na kagoma, inyenzi, ibisimba hamwe ninyoni. Nubwoko bwibisimba bikunze kugaragara kumugabane wa Afrika. \nInyandiko.\nInyoni ishyigikiwe ifite amababa hepfo gusa kumutwe no mumajosi, amababa yagutse cyane n'amababa magufi. Ifite ijosi ryera. Umugongo wera utandukanye nubundi umwijima wijimye. Abana bato ni umwijima. Ni inyoni iciriritse; umubiri wacyo ni 4.2\u00a0kugeza 7.2\u00a0kg (9.3\u201315.9\u00a0lb), ni 78 to 98\u00a0cm (31 kugeza 39\u00a0muri) ndende kandi ifite 1.96 to 2.25\u00a0m (6\u00a0ft 5\u00a0kugeza kuri 7\u00a0ft 5\u00a0in) amababa. "}
{"id": "14608", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14608", "title": "Inkona yo muri Afurika", "text": "African fish eagle (Haliaeetus vocifer) cyangwa ibikona byo mu nyanja yo muri africa, ni ubwoko bunini bwa kagoma iboneka muri Afurika yo munsi y'Ubutayu bwa Sahara ahantu hose haboneka imibiri minini y'amazi afunguye hamwe n'ibiribwa byinshi. Ninyoni yigihugu ya Malawi, Namibiya, Zambiya, na Zimbabwe. Nkibisubizo byurwego runini, bizwi mu ndimi nyinshi. Ingero zamazina zirimo: Vis Arend muri Afrikaans, \"nkwazi\" muri Chewa, \"aigle p\u00eacheur\" mu gifaransa, \"hungwe\" muri Shona, \"inkwazi\" muri isiZulu, na \"nt\u0161hu\" (bisobanurwa ngo \"ntjhu\") mu majyaruguru ya Sotho. Ubu bwoko bushobora gusa na kagoma yumusatsi igaragara; nubwo bifitanye isano, amoko yombi aboneka kumugabane utandukanye, kagoma yumusatsi iba muri Amerika ya ruguru."}
{"id": "14609", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14609", "title": "Igiti cy'igihondohondo", "text": "Igihondohondo ni igiti kiba kubutumburuke bwa metero kuva 1300 kugeza kuri 2500, kigera kuri m 15 z'uburebure, Ni igiti cya koreshwaga cyane mu mihango y'abakurambere bu Rwanda. Umutiba wa cm 25-35 z'umurambararo, ufite amashami menshi mu ikamba, hamwe n'inkovu z'amababi zigaragara igihe kirekire. amababi ya alterne, coriace, yaka cyane icyatsi kibisi, yuzuye muri rosettes zanyuma, zimeze nkinkota, base ifashe kugeza kuri cm 130 z'uburebure na cm 16 z'ubugari. Inflorescence, gutondeka neza, indabyo nyinshi zigera kuri cm 100 na cm 70-150 z'ubugari.indabyo grenish yera kugeza kuri cm 1.5 z'uburebure.imbuto imbuto zijimye zijimye zigera kuri cm 1,5 kugeza kuri 2 lon na 1.5. kugeza kuri cm 3 z'ubugari."}
{"id": "14610", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14610", "title": "Umuranda", "text": "Umuranda ni Igihingwa cyo mubwoko bwa aliana, ni igiti gikurira hamwe nibindi biti, kiba ahantu hubutumburuke kuva kuri metero 1300 kugeza kuri metero 2300. Umuranda ku mutwe hatwikiriwe n' indimu yumushatsi wijimye, indabyo zingirakamaro cyangwa mumoko yacyo atandukanye, igishyitsi gitandukanye, imbuto icyatsi, gihinduka umutuku werurutse iyo cyeze, gifashwe mumababi nkibice. umuzabibu utangaje ushobora kugera kuri m 9 z'uburebure. igishyitsi cyacyo, uruti rwacyo cyangwa ibyatsi byose ni ligneous. ibibabi bisobekeranye bifite metero 2 kugeza 4,5 z'uburebure, ikibabi cyibabi ndetse na metero 4 kugeza 13 z'ubugari.Umuranda ugira akamaro gakomeye mu muvuzuvi gakondo."}
{"id": "14611", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14611", "title": "Umumara", "text": "Umumara ni umuzabibu ugaragara neza uhagaze hamwe na mashami akiri mato. Umumara ugira ibishishwa bifite cm 1 kugeza kuri 4.6 z'uburebure Umumara amoko 2, nka Umumara ugira amababi ya foliole, uyu ugira amababi atangira kumera iyo ufite metero 1.4 z'uburebure kugeza kuri metero 6 z'uburebure. Umumara ugira amababi ya Mediane foliole utangira kugira amababi kuri cm 2.2 z'uburebure kugeza kuri cm 20 z'uburebure. \numumara ufite umunyu wa kalisiyumu ikingira rubagimpande. Gifite proteyine na vitamini bituma kinogeka neza mu nda. Gifite imbaraga zikiza zirenze urugero. Gufata ikirayi kinini, kugikamuramo umutobe, kuwuvanga n\u2019ubuki. Ibyo bivura kuziba kw\u2019amara, kwituma uribwa, kuribwa mu nda, kuva amaraso mu menyo, impatwe, rubagimpande, indwara ya goutte, kuribwa mu gifu, kugonga kw\u2019amara, indurwe nyinshi mu gifu (ari na yo itera ikirungurira), kivura kandi impiswi n\u2019ibisebe byo mu mara."}
{"id": "14612", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14612", "title": "Ikirogora", "text": "Ikirogora brillantaisia) ni umuti kikaba n\u2019imboga kiri mu bihingwa by\u2019inyongeramirire. Ikirogora kera cyifashishwaga mu kuvura kuko gifasha abarwayi ba Diabete cyangwa abantu bahorana umunaniro n\u2019isereri. Ikirogora gifasha gukiza kwa kuzahara guterwa n\u2019uburozi, Ikirogora kirwanya infection\u2019 mu maraso barozwe kuko uburozi bugira ingaruka, gihangana n\u2019uburozi umubiri ukongera ugakora neza. Ikirogora gifasha mu gusukura amaraso ku bafite ibibazo bitandukanye. "}
{"id": "14613", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14613", "title": "Magaru", "text": "Magaru (hypoestes triflora) ni ikimera gikunda kuba mu ishyamba, mu misozicyangwa mu bishanga. Magaru ni umuti kikaba n\u2019imboga kiri mu bihingwa by\u2019inyongeramirire. Magaru kera cyifashishwaga mu kuvura kuko gifasha abarwayi ba Diabete cyangwa abantu bahorana umunaniro n\u2019isereri. Magaru gifasha gukiza kwa kuzahara guterwa n\u2019uburozi, Magaru kirwanya infection mu maraso ndetse Magaru ikura uburozi mu mubiri hamwe n'ingaruka zabwo. Magaru gihangana n\u2019uburozi mu m'umubiri ukongera ugakora neza. Ikirogora gifasha mu gusukura amaraso ku bafite ibibazo bitandukanye."}
{"id": "14614", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14614", "title": "Nkuriyumwonga", "text": "Nkuriyumwonga ni ikimera gikunda kuba mu migezi, iruhande rw'imihanda cyangwa mu bishanga ku butumburuke bwa metero 1900 kugeza ku 2400. Nkuriyumwonga ni umuti kikaba n\u2019imboga kiri mu bihingwa by\u2019inyongeramirire. Nkuriyumwonga kera cyifashishwaga mu kuvura kuko gifasha abarwayi ba Diabete cyangwa abantu bahorana umunaniro n\u2019isereri. Nkuriyumwonga gifasha gukiza kwa kuzahara guterwa n\u2019uburozi,Nkuriyumwonga kirwanya infection mu maraso ndetse Magaru ikura uburozi mu mubiri hamwe n'ingaruka zabwo. Nkuriyumwonga gihangana n\u2019uburozi mu m'umubiri ukongera ugakora neza. Ikirogora gifasha mu gusukura amaraso ku bafite ibibazo bitandukanye."}
{"id": "14615", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14615", "title": "Nkurimwonga", "text": "Nkurimwonga ni ikimera gikunda kuba hafi yahantu hari umuswa cyangwa aho wahoze, kiba mu ishyamba ku butumburucye bwa metero 1200 kugeza kuri metero 2500. Nkurimwonga ni umuti kikaba n\u2019imboga kiri mu bihingwa by\u2019inyongeramirire. Nkurimwonga kera cyifashishwaga mu kuvura kuko gifasha abarwayi ba Diabete cyangwa abantu bahorana umunaniro n\u2019isereri. Nkurimwonga gifasha gukiza kwa kuzahara guterwa n\u2019uburozi, Nkurimwonga kirwanya infection mu maraso ndetse Magaru ikura uburozi mu mubiri hamwe n'ingaruka zabwo. Nkurimwonga gihangana n\u2019uburozi mu m'umubiri ukongera ugakora neza. Ikirogora gifasha mu gusukura amaraso ku bafite ibibazo bitandukanye."}
{"id": "14616", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14616", "title": "Gitinywa", "text": "Gitinywa cyangwa cyitwa bugleweed, gikunda kuba ku kumuhanda, ahantu hafite ubutumburuke bwa metero 1700 kugeza kuri 2400. Gitinywa ni ikimera cyifashishwa mu buvuzi gakondo no gukora imiti, Gukoresha ibyatsi byacyo hamwe ni bibabi byacyo bito bito bivura ndetse Kurandura imizi yacyo bikaba bikomeye cyane. Gitinywa nicyo giti cyakoreeshwa mu kuvura ibimeme. Kigabanya ububabare bwica haba mu mutwe, ibisebe byo mu kanwa, ndetse cyikavura mugihe waviriyemo imbere. Gitinywa ifasha ibikomere, ibisebe, amagufwa yangiritse, ndetse no gufungana mu muhogo."}
{"id": "14617", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14617", "title": "Bateleur", "text": "Igisiga cya bateleur.\nBateleur cyangwa se terathopius ecaudatus ni inyoni yo mu muryango wa acciipitriade\nbikunze gufatwa nkimwe mu nkomgoro bitirira inzoka, ishyirwa mu bice bya circaetinea.\nni imwe mu zigize ubwoko bwa terathopius.kandi ishobora inkomoko y'inyoni za zambiya \nBateleur.\nBateleur ni inyoni nini idasanzwe, birashoboka kwari iyakabiri mu burebure mu bwoko\nbwa circaetinea, kugeza ubu igisiga kinini ni igisiga cyo mumuryango wa kagoma \nya filipine iyirenzeho inshuro ebyiri.\nBateleur ifite (55 to 70cm (22 to 28 in) mu burebure iyo bwiyongereye igera kuri\nimirire naho kuba "}
{"id": "14618", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14618", "title": "Long crested Eagle", "text": "Inkukuma ndende (Lophaetus occipitalis) ni inyoni yo muri Afurika ihiga. Kimwe na kagoma zose, ni mumuryango Accipitridae. Kugeza ubu ishyizwe mubwoko bumwe bwa Lophaetus. Irangwa namababa agize igikonjo. Iraboneka hagati ya Afrika yepfo na Afrika yepfo hamwe nurugo rutandukanye bitewe no kuboneka kwibiryo hamwe n\u2019ahantu heza ho gutura ariko bikaba ahanini ku nkombe z\u2019amashyamba no hafi y\u2019ahantu h\u2019ubushuhe. ninyoni yororoka buri umwaka bitewe nibiryo biboneka, itera amagi kuva kuri 1 kugeza kuri 2 aterwa, nkuko biranga abashimusi. Byongeye kandi, nkubwoko bwa raptor, Inyoni zikuze zikunze kurya inyamaswa z\u2019inyamabere ntoya, icyakora izindi nyababyeyi n\u2019inyamaswa zidafite ubuzima nazo ziribwa."}
{"id": "14619", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14619", "title": "Nyiramabumba", "text": "Nyiramabumba iba mu misozi na mashyamba ku butumburuke bwa metero 1600 kugeza kuri metero 2600. Nyiramabumba ni ikimera aho kumutwe kiba kimeze nki ngofero, ni igiti cy'ubaka kuva kuva kubuhagarike bwa cm 10-15 z'uburebure, amababi asimburana yuma haza andi kandi ashimishije, kuva hejuru ya cm 2-15 z'uburebure ku bice bibiri. Nyiramabumba nti byoroshye gukoraho kuko iraryana (Irababana) igira utubabi twinshi duto duto cyane, kuzunguruka hejuru kandi gacikamo koroshye."}
{"id": "14620", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14620", "title": "Umuhurura", "text": "Umuhurura utarandaranda ni ikimera cy'ifashishwa mu kuvura irwara zitandukanye, kuko nka mabababi y'muhurura uyarambika aharwaye igisebe kigakira, afasha mukuvura ishaza ryo mujisho, uvuguta amababi ugakamura ikijojoba muri buri jisho, inda y'umugore utwite yenda kuvamo, iyo uwuseku mu isekuru maze ugashiramo amazi nka litiro, uvura ububabare, mugihe uhekenye amababi yawo, ukavura kubyimba umwijima ibitetse muri litiro y'amazi ukannya igice cy'ikirahure mu by'umweru 3, Umuhururura ufasha mukuvura irwara z'uruhu, Umuhurura ufite imyungu ngugu, Umuhurura urirwa nkimboga."}
{"id": "14621", "revid": "10821", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14621", "title": "Black kite", "text": "Black Kite\nBlack Kite ni inyoni nini yo mubwoko bw'inyamanswa mu muryango \nwa Accipitridae.bikeka ko hariho ubwoko bwinshi mu bwoko bwa \naccipitridae, nubwo ubwoko bumwe bwagize ihungabana rikabije.\namababa yayo afite inguni n'umurizo wihariye byoroshye kubibona\ncyangwa se kubimenya, akaba ari inyoni ifite amajwi mwenshi."}
{"id": "14622", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14622", "title": "Swallow tailed kite", "text": "Swallow Tailed Kite.\nSwalled tailed kite ni inyoni ikomoka mu muryango wa Pernine ukomoka \nmu majyepfo ya amerika, ugana mu burasirazuba bwa peru no mumajyaruguru\nya argentine. ni ubwoko bwonyine mu bwoko bwa Elaniodes.\nImiterere.\nSwallow tailed tike ipima (50 to 68cm (20 to 27in) mu burebure,hamwe na\namababa (1.12-1.36M (3.7-4.5 ft) ifite umubiri utandukanye cyane\nn'umukara n'umweru, uruhande ryo hejuru rw'amababa rurirabura hamwe \nn'umurizo, umurizo,ibirenge "}
{"id": "14623", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14623", "title": "Black shoulded kike", "text": "Black shoulded Kite (Elanus axillaris), izwi kandi ku izina rya Ositaraliya ryitwa umukara wigitugu,\nni inyoni ntoya ihiga iboneka ahantu hatuje muri Ositaraliya. Irasa n'ubwoko busa buboneka muri Afurika,\nmuri Aziya no muri Amerika ya Ruguru, harimo n'akabuto k'amababa y'umukara, ubwoko bwahoze bwitwa \"akayaga k'igitugu\".\nGupima hafi 35\u00a0cm (14)\u00a0muri) mu burebure, hamwe n'amababa ya 80\u2013100\u00a0cm (31-39\u00a0muri), \nabakuze bitugu-bitugu kite ifite ahanini ibara ryera-ryera hamwe nibimenyetso byirabura bigaragara hejuru yijisho ryumutuku.\nYabonye izina ryayo uhereye kumababi yumukara kumababa yayo. Ihamagarwa ryibanze ni ifirimbi isobanutse,\nivugwa mu ndege kandi mugihe igenda. Irashobora kwitiranywa ninyuguti zifitanye isano ninyoni zifite amababa muri\nOsitaraliya, itandukanijwe nibimenyetso byirabura bitangaje munsi yamababa yayo. imirire "}
{"id": "14624", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14624", "title": "Igishwi gito", "text": "Igishwi gito (Accipiter minullus) ni ubwoko bwinyoni ya Afrotropical yinyamanswa mu muryango wa Accipitridae. Ni umunyamuryango muto muto wo mubwoko bwa \"Acipiter.\"\nIbisobanuro.\nIgishwi gito ni, nkuko izina ryacyo ryerekana inyoni ntoya cyane yinyamanswa nayo itandukanijwe amababa abiri yera kuruhande rwamababa yumurizo wacyo hagati hamwe nigitambara cyera cyera kumurongo wo hasi. Abana bato bafite ibara ryijimye muri rusange bafite amabara yera kumababa yo hejuru kandi agaragara hamwe yakuze munsi aho kubuzwa kandi amababa ya rump afite inama zera gusa, kandi yerekana umwijima. Ku bantu bakuru fagitire ni umukara, amaguru maremare n'amano maremare ni umuhondo, cere ni umuhondo kandi amaso ni umuhondo mwinshi; mu bana bato bafite ibara ry'umuhondo-icyatsi n'amaso yijimye. Uburebure ni 23\u201327\u00a0cm (9.1-10.6\u00a0in) ; amababa ni 39\u201350\u00a0cm (15-20\u00a0muri), igitsina gabo gipima 74\u201385\u00a0g (2.6\u20133.0\u00a0oz) n'umugore 68\u2013105\u00a0g (2.4\u20133.7\u00a0oz). \nIkwirakwizwa n'aho uba.\nIgishwi gito kiboneka mu burasirazuba no mu majyepfo ya Afurika yo munsi y'Ubutayu bwa Sahara muri Etiyopiya mu majyepfo kugera muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo no mu majyaruguru ya Angola, mu majyepfo kugera mu burasirazuba bwa Cape muri Afurika y'Epfo. \nIgishwi gito ni inyoni yo mu ishyamba ishobora kuboneka mu mashyamba y\u2019ibiti na scrub, ubusanzwe hafi y\u2019ibibaya. \nImyitwarire.\nIgishwi gito ni monogamous na teritwari wenyine. Iyerekana ry'umugabo rimubona yicaye hamwe n'umubiri we ufashwe ugereranije na perch ihindagurika umutwe we uruhande rumwe. Umugore afata inshingano nyinshi zo kubaka icyari yubaka urubuga ruto rufite umurongo muto wamababi yicyatsi. Azakoresha icyari gishaje cya shikra cyangwa gabar goshawk aho kwiyubakira icyari cye. \nIgishwi gito kigizwe na superspecies hamwe nigishwi gitukura cyibishishwa bitukura \"(Accipiter erythropus)\" kandi amoko yombi agize ubwoko bushobora kuba bwitwa \"Tachyspiza\". "}
{"id": "14625", "revid": "10821", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14625", "title": "VERREAUX'S EAGLE", "text": "Verreaux's Eagle.\nni inyoni nini cyane, cyane muri africa akaba ari inyoni ihiga \nyitwa kandi kagoma yirabura cyane cyane muri afrika yepfo, igaragara no \nmu muburasirazuba bwa Aziya, ituye mu misozi no mumajyepfo ya nomuburasirazuba\nbwa africa,ndetse no muri africa y'iburengera zuba mu gace ki burasirazuba bwo hagati.\nIyi nyoni nimwe mubwoko bwihariye bwa Accipitride kw'isi hamwe n'ikwirakwiza ryayo\nkubwoko bukunda guhiga Hyraxes.\nImiterere.\niyi kagoma nini cyane ingana na (75 to 96Cm (30 to 38 in) ikaba ari kagoma ya 3 kw'isi.\nakaba ari kagoma ya karindwi cyangwa umunani iremereye kw'isi.\nverreaux's ifite ibara ry'umuhondo,ifite kandi umweru uri inyuma ndetse numurizo\ny'umukara.ikunda gutotera kumazi, amafi, utundi tunyabuzi duto duto nk'utunyenzi\namphibia n'ibindi. "}
{"id": "14626", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14626", "title": "Ibyo kurya bifasha ubwonko", "text": "Nta gushidikanya ko ibyo turya aribyo biha ubushobozi ubwonko mu kazi ko kugenzura ibikorwa ibyo aribyo byose, cyane ko abahanga mu mirire bavuga ko \"Turi ibyo turya\" kandi ngo \"Amagara aramirwa, ntamerwa.\"\nIbyo wamenya kubyo Kurya bifasha Ubwonko.\nMu biryo turya, harimo ibiribwa bifasha ubwonko bwacu gukora neza nk\u2019uko no ku zindi ngingo z\u2019umubiri bigenda. Ibi rero twagombye kubibuha buri munsi, umuntu akaba yavuga ati \u2018uyu munsi ubwonko ndabufashije, na bwo buraza kumfasha. Ntabwo nzi niba abantu bajya babitekerezaho ariko muri rusange ibiribwa bikize ku bintu birinda ubwonko kwangirika (antioxydant) ni byo bifasha ubwonko bwacu kutangirika.\u201d\"Ubwonko nk\u2019igice fatizo cy\u2019umubiri kigenzura ibyo ukora byose, nabwo bukenera intungamubiri ziva mu byo turya bya buri munsi nk\u2019uko umubiri ubikenera. Nubwo umuntu afata ibiribwa bifite intungamubiri zitandukanye hari ibiba bifite umumaro ukomeye ku gice runaka.\"Usibye ibiribwa byiganjemo imboga n\u2019imbuto,amazi nayo ari ikinyobwa kitakwirengagizwa mu bintu bifasha ubwonko bw\u2019umuntu gukora neza kuko agira uruhare runini mu gukwirakwiza intungamubiri mu mubiri wose kandi akanatanga umwuka wo guhumeka (Oxygen), cyane ko no mu biyagize urimo.Abantu benshi ntibakunze kubyitaho, ariko hari ibyonnyi byitwa (Radicaux libre) byangiza ubwonko biturutse ku mikorere isanzwe y\u2019umubiri wacu, ibiryo bitetse nabi cyangwa se bikaba byanaturuka ku bidukikije. Buriya n\u2019ibiryo bitetse muri micro-ondes byongera ibyonnyi by\u2019ubwonko.\u201d\nTumenye ibyo kurya bifasha ubwonko.\nUbushakashatsi bugaragaza ko umuntu yari akwiye kurya imboga n\u2019imbuto by\u2019ubwoko butanu ku munsi kandi nta munsi n\u2019umwe asibye.Amazi ni kimwe mu bifasha cyane ubwonko gukora neza. Nibura umuntu ufite ibilo 60 agomba kunywa litiro ebyiri ku munsi. Kugira ngo umenye ingano y\u2019amazi ugomba kunywa ku munsi, ufata ingano y\u2019ibilo byawe ukagabanya inshuro 30.\u201dBavugako abantu badakwiriye kuvanga ibintu mu mazi ngo akunde aborohere kuyanywa, kuko iyo atagifite umwimerere wayo, aba atakiri amazi. Umuntu agomba kunywa amazi atagira ibara, atagira impumuro adafite uburyohe kandi meza.Imyitozo ngororamubiri ni igikorwa cya gatatu abantu bose bakwiye kwitabira mu rwego rwo kurinda ubwonko bwabo kuko iri mu biburinda kwangirika, bukabasha gukora neza kandi igihe cyose.Ubushakashatsi buherutse gukorwa bugaragaza ko nibura umuntu udafite ikibazo kindi cy\u2019ubuzima agomba gukora siporo hagati y\u2019iminota 30 n\u2019isaha imwe kandi bigakorwa buri munsi.Amaronji, soya na karoti: Ibi nabyo bikungahaye kuri vitamini C, E na A, nabyo bibarirwa mu bifasha ubwonko gukora neza kuko bifasha umuntu kwibuka nta ngorane ahuye nazo.Ibiribwa bifasha ubwonko gukora neza ni nka tungurusumu, amata na puwavuro (Poivron).Umuvuzi uvura akoresheje ibimera, avuga ko tungurusumu ituma umutima utera neza bitewe n\u2019uko itunganya amaraso.Tungurusumu ikaba inaboneka mu biribwa bishinzwe gutunganya no kuvura imitsi minini kandi muri iyo mitsi imyinshi iba ikora ku bwonko.\nIbindi byo kurya bifasha.\nAvoka ni urubuto rwihariye kuko irimo vitamini zigera kuri 11, muri zo harimo vitamini E izwiho gusukura. Ubushakashatsi bwerekana ko kurya avoka birwanya ibyago byo kurwara indwara ya \"Alzheimer\u2019s\" ikaba ifata ubwonko igatera kwibagirwa aho ushobora no kwibagirwa aho utaha cyangwa izina ryawe.Ibihwagari nabyo bikungahaye kuri vitamini E. Muri garama 30 za twa tubuto dukaranze nkuko ukaranga ubunyobwa harimo 30% bya vitamini E ukeneye ku munsi. Kubirya gutyo cyangwa gukora agasosi kabyo ni ingenzi mu kongerera ingufu ubwenge.Ubushakashatsi bugenda bugaragaza ko abantu banywa divayi itukura ariko ntibarenze akarahure 1 ku munsi bakagafata nyuma yo kurya, ubwonko bwabo bwibuka cyane kurenza abanywa bakarenza urugero. Si ibyo \u00a0gusa kuko alukolo muri rusange ku gipimo cyemewe ituma ubwenge bushabuka ndetse ukibuka vuba. Hari abavuga ko kunywa inzoga nke mbere y\u2019ikizami ngo bifasha kwibuka no gutsinda, ariko nta bushakashatsi burabyemeza.Bwaba ubunyobwa bukaranze, bubisi se cyangwa isosi yabwo ni isoko y\u2019ibinure na vitamini E. Ibyo binure ni ingenzi kuko nibyo bikoze ubwonko dore ko ahanini ari ibinure. Ni bwiza rero ku bwonko no ku mikorere y\u2019umutima. Utabonye ubunyobwa wabusimbuza almond (amande).Amafi ya salmon, mackerel, tilapia, sardines n\u2019izindi zikungahaye kuri bya binure bya omega-3, birimo DHA (Docosahexaenoic acid).Iyi DHA mu bwonko ni ingenzi cyane kuko ituma uturandaryi two mu bwonko dukora neza. Twibutseko iyo akarandaryi kamwe kangiritse kadasimburwa.Imboga zinyuranye nka epinari, broccoli, imbwija, dodo n\u2019izindi ni isoko nziza ya vitamini E na B9. Vitamini B9 ishwanyaguza \"homocysteine\" iyi ikaba izwiho gutuma uturemangingo two mu bwonko dupfa ikanatera ibibazo by\u2019umutima, vitamini B9 ibi byose irabirwanya,Inkeri mu moko yazo yose, zaba inkeri zitukura cyangwa izirabura, zifasha ubwonko mu kwibuka no gukora neza. Ibyo zibikora zifasha umubiri gusohora poroteyine zahindutse nk\u2019uburozi zishobora kwangiza imikorere myiza y\u2019ubwonko.Impeke ni ibyo kurya bikungahaye kuri fibres. Iyo tuvuga impeke tuba tuvuga umuceri, ingano, ibigori, utubuto twa sezame, inzuzi z\u2019ibihaza, uburo, amasaka. Ibi byo kurya byo muri ubu bwoko ntibivuze ngo ubirye byonyine, ahubwo bishyirwa mu yandi mafunguro. Ushobora kubinywa mu gikoma, kubirya, bigafasha umubiri gusohora imyanda bityo bikarinda iyangirika ry\u2019imitsi ijyana amaraso mu bwonko.Shokola zirabura Izi chocolat zitandukanye n\u2019izindi kuko zirimo ibirinda umubiri uburozi bunyuranye, ibikangura umubiri, harimo kandi na caffeine nkeya izwiho gutuma umubiri ukora endorphins, zikaba zituma imitekerereze igenda neza cyane.Gusa ku munsi ntugomba kurenza hagati ya 15g na 30g zayo kuko iyo ibaye nyinshi bitera ibindi bibazo nanone.Ibishyimbo mu moko yabyo yose, byaba nyirabukara, mutiki, kiryumukwe, kiryugaramye, lentilles, n\u2019andi moko, biri mu biribwa bikungahaye kuri glucose. Glucose nk\u2019isukari, itera ingufu mu mubiri kandi ubwonko nicyo gice cya mbere mu mubiri gikoresha ingufu nyinshi. Kubirya bituma ubwonko butananirwa mu mikorere yabwo. Agace k\u2019igikombe ku munsi karahagije."}
{"id": "14627", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14627", "title": "Igifashi", "text": "Igifashi ni ikimera cy'igiti kigenda kinyerera uko kigenda kizamuka gikura, ibyatsi cyangwa amababi akivaho ashobora kugera kuri metero nyinshi z'uburebure. Igifashi umutwe wacyo ugenda witambika ukingoronzora. Igifashi gifite indabyo z'icyatsi kibisi n'umuhondo zometse ku mababi yacyo, ndende. imbuto zacyo zisa ni kapucile. Igifashi kiravura mu buvuzi gakondo nki miti itandukanye nk'igikomere cyangwa igisebe, kuvura diyare cyangwa guhitwa, kwiruka, ubugumba. Imizi yacyo irafasha mu kuvura umugore utwite no kubyara."}
{"id": "14628", "revid": "10821", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14628", "title": "Martial Eagle", "text": "Martial Eagle.\nMartial Eagle ni kagoma nini ikomoka muri africa yo munsi y'ubutayu bwa sahara.\nakaba ari umunyamuryango wenyine mu bwoko bwa polemeatus.\nni ubwoko bwa kagoma ifite amababa hejuru ya tarsus, ni bumwe mu bwoko \nkandi bukomeye cyane bwa kagoma. akaba ari bumwe mu bwoko bwa \nkagoma buzwiho guhiga cyane."}
{"id": "14629", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14629", "title": "Crowned Eagle", "text": "Crowned Eagle.\ncrowned eagle izi kandi nanone kwizina rya kagoma yo muri africa yambitswe ikamba\ncyangwa se igikona ni inyoni ikomoka mu muryango wa Stephanoaetus.\nni inyoni nini y'inyamaswa iboneka muri Afrika yo munsi y'ubutayu bwa sahara \nmuri afrika yepfo ugana iburasirazuba, ahantu ikunda ni mumashyamba, amashyamba\ny'ibyuzi na amashyamba atandukanye \numuhigo nyamukuru uyigaburira n'udusimba guto."}
{"id": "14630", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14630", "title": "Osprey", "text": "Ibyo wamenya kuri osprey.\nOsprey ni inyoni nini ingana na (60Cm to(24 In) uburebure \nbwa (180 Cm (70 in) Osprey yihanganira ahantu hatandukanye\niterera ahantu hose hafi y'ibiti cyangwa hafi y'umugezi wamazi \nutanga ibiryo bihagije iboneka ku migabane yose usibye uwa \natarantica. nubwo i boneka mu ri amerika y'amajyepfo gusa \nizinyoni ntago zikunda kurorokerayo. "}
{"id": "14631", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14631", "title": "African Marsh Harrier", "text": "African Marsh Herrier.\nAfrican Marsh Herrier ni inyoni ikomoka mu woko bwa circus, ikunda ahantu hagizwe\nn'igishanga kiri mu majyepfo yo hagati y'iburengerazuba bwa bwa africa\nimiturire.\niboneka mu bishanga byo muri africa bikunze kuboneka mu rubingo rwo mu burasirszuba\nndetse no mu mirima iri hafi y'ibishanga,ituye cyane cyane muture two mu majyepfo\nno mumajyaruguru ya africa uherereye Rwanda nomu burengerazuba bwa cape town, iboneka muri\nlesoto,eswatin,zimbabwe, mozambike,Malawi, angola nahandi henshi muri africa."}
{"id": "14632", "revid": "10821", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14632", "title": "Wahlberg's eagle", "text": "Wahlberg's Eagle.\nni inyoni y'inyamaswa ikomoka muri africa munsi y'ubutayu bwa sahara \naho iba mubihuru cyangwa ishyamba,iyi nyoni yiswe n'umuhanga \nmu binyabuzima n'ibidukikije Johan August, kimwe na kagoma zose \nzo mu muryango wa Accipitridae.\nimiterere.\niyi nyoni ifite (53-61 Cm (21-24 in)amwe n'amababa angana \nna (130-146Cm (21-24 in) ifite umutwe w'igikonjo gito, kandi\namaguri ni umuhondo, ikagira ibara ryijimwe munsi y'amababa. "}
{"id": "14633", "revid": "10821", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14633", "title": "Swamp Harreir", "text": "swamp Herrier.\ninyi nyoni yitiriwe ibishanga no kwizina rya Marrale yo muri Ositarariya ni inyoni nini\nyorohejwe yo mubwoko bw'inyamanswa yororokoka cyane muri ositarariya,muri\nnouvelle-Zelande izwi kandi kwizina rya Herrier hawk cyangwa kwizina rya Maori\niyi nyoni kandi ikomoka mu muryango muto wa circinae,ni ubwoko bwa circus \nbugaragara kw'isi yose. "}
{"id": "14634", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14634", "title": "Lizzard buzzard", "text": "Lizzard Buzzard.\nIYI nyoni ikunze kwiktirirwa umuserebanya cyangwa se Lizzard,ni inyoni ihiga umuryango \nwa Accipitridae, ikomoka munsi y'ubutayu bwa sahara nubwo izina ryayo yishobora \nkuba rifite isano rya hafi na Acipiter hawks,kuruta Buteo buzzard.\nImiterere.\niyi nyoni yitiriwe umuserebanya ifite umurambararo ungana 35-37 CM hamwe n'amababa 79Cm.\nibice byo hejuru umutwe n'amababa birasa, ikagira umurongo w'umukara wera, ifire kunda h\nhera n'umwijima mwiza umurizo n'umukara ufite umutwe wera amaso yijimye,ikagira amaguru\ny'umuhondo."}
{"id": "14635", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14635", "title": "Grasshopper Buzzard", "text": "Brasshopper Buzzard.\nNinyoni yo mu bwoko bwa Butastur zihiga mu muryango wa Accipitridae ziboneka\nmu gace kagufi ka africa yo munsi y'ubutayu bwa sahara.mu muryango wa\nAccipitridae. \niyi nyoni ifite ibara ryijimye hejuru hamwe n'umutwe wijimye.ifite ibara rtijimye\nku mababa yayo yose, ifite urwasaya n'umuhogo byera n'amaguru y'umuhondo\nikagira uburebure bwa (30-35Cm (12-14 in) amababa (90Cm (35 in) ubureburemere \nbwa (310-340G (11-12 oZ) ingabo zo biratandukanye kuko yo igera (300-380g (11-12oZ)"}
{"id": "14636", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14636", "title": "African hawk Eagle", "text": "African Hawk Eagle.\nni inyoni nini ihiga, kimwe na kagoma zose ikomoka mu muryango wa Accipitridae.\nubu bwoko maaguru afite amababa kimwe nko mubwoko bwa Aquilinae.iki gikona \nkandi cyororoka muri africa munsi y'ubutayu bwa sahara ni inyoni iboneka mu mashyamba\natandukanye harimo na savanna hamwe n'imisozi miremire ariko bikunze kugaragara nanone\nmi mashyamba yumye."}
{"id": "14637", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14637", "title": "Short toed snack eagle", "text": "Short Toed Snack Eagle.\nInyoni ikomoka mu muryango wa Circaetus Gillicus ikaba izwi kandi ku izina \nrya kagoma ngufi. ni inyoni nini yo mu bwoko bw'inyamanswa mu muryango \nwa Accipitridae, ikubiyemo n'ubundi bwoko bwinshi nka kite,Buzzard na harrier.\nizina ry'ubwoko ciraetus rikomoka kuri kirkos ya kera yikigereki, ubwoko bw'igikona\nna aetos,kagoma Gallicus yihariye isobanura ya Galiya. "}
{"id": "14638", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14638", "title": "Akamenampishyi", "text": "Akamenampishyi ni ikimera gikunda kuba mu gihuru kiba kubutaka bufite ubutumburuke bwa metero 1800 kugeza 2500.\nIrwara kivura.\nAkamenampishyi gufite imizi, igiti amashami n'amababi, kandi ibibabi yumweru byose biravura, irwara zitandukanye. Kuribwa mu mihogo,wumva humye n'agakorora kumye cyangwa angine yo mu muhogo, gapfura, sinesite, Kuva imyuna mu mazuru cyangwa se gukanuka, Ibicurane hamwe n'ibimwira byinshi mu mazuru, Ku barwayi bwa Grippe, Kutaryoherwa(kubura appetit, Gusarara(Kubura Ijwi), Umwuma mu muhogo."}
{"id": "14639", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14639", "title": "Ivumavumwe", "text": "Ivumavumwe ni ikimera gikunda kuba mu gihuru kiba kubutaka bufite ubutumburuke bwa metero 1800 kugeza 2500. Ivumavumwe gufite imizi, igiti amashami n'amababi, kandi ibibabi yumweru byose biravura, irwara zitandukanye. Kuribwa mu mihogo,wumva humye n'agakorora kumye cyangwa angine yo mu muhogo, gapfura, sinesite, Kuva imyuna mu mazuru cyangwa se gukanuka, Ibicurane hamwe n'ibimwira byinshi mu mazuru, Ku barwayi bwa Grippe, Kutaryoherwa(kubura appetit, Gusarara, Kubura Ijwi, Umwuma mu muhogo."}
{"id": "14640", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14640", "title": "PYGMY FALCON", "text": "Pygmy Falcon.\nNI Inyoni y'inyamanswa ikomoka mu burasirazuba bwa afrika yepfo\nni ubwoko bwonyine bushirwa Polihierax.\nfalcon kandi ikunda kuba mu gihuru cyumye.iboneka muri sudan yepfo\nkugera muri somaliya, uganda,angola, kugera mu majyaruguru ya afrika yepfo.\nuru ruhererekane bufite ubuso bwa Million 2.7km ' square, ubushakashatsi buvugako \ninyoni zose hamwe ziri hagati ya 100,000 na million. "}
{"id": "14641", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14641", "title": "Gutwikumwe", "text": "Gutwikumwe ni ikimera gikunda kuba ahantu hubuta hatose, nko mu bitare bya'amabuye, hujuru y'umugezi, cyangwa mu misozi miremire mu gihuru kiba kubutaka bufite ubutumburuke bwa metero 1400 kugeza 2000 nokuzamura. Gutwikumwe ni igihingwa gito gikunze kurandaranda, Gutwikumwe ifite umugozi cyangwa igiti cyacyo gifashe kumizi imeze nk'imfundo. Gutwikumwe ni umuti uvura ibimeme, infection, diabete n'izindi rwara z'abagore, ntse cyakoreshwaga kuura igifu n'ibisebe. Gutwikumwe yakoreshwaga mu gukuna abakobwa n'abagore."}
{"id": "14642", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14642", "title": "Dark chanting Goshawk", "text": "Dark chanting Goshawk.\nni inyoni ihiga mu muryango wa Accipitidae iboneka hirya no hino muri africa no mumajyepfo \nya arabiya ikana ifite umubare muke ugaragara mu majyepfo ya maroke.\nDark chanting Goshawk ifite umutwe igituza nigice cyo hejuru n'umwijima, mugihe igice \ncyo hasi usibye amabere n'umukara birera, amababa n'umurizo birirabura hamwe n'umweru\nikagira amaguru maremare asa orange n'umutuku. ugereranije igitsina gole ni kinini kuruta \nigitsina gabo gipima 840G, kugeza ku gitimo ntarengwa cy'umugabo 700G "}
{"id": "14644", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14644", "title": "Ibyo kurya wasangamo ubutare", "text": "Ubutare (fer/iron) buri ku rugero ruhagije mu mubiri ni ingenzi cyane, kuko ari umunyungugu witabazwa mu gufasha uturemangingo tw\u2019amaraso gutwara umwuka mwiza wa oxygen mu bice bitandukanye by\u2019umubiri. Ubutare kandi bwitabazwa mu gukora imbaraga umubiri ukoresha. \nIyo bubaye buke, bishobora gutera indwara ya anemia (irangwa no kugira amaraso macye) ndetse no guhorana umunaniro udashira.\nNubwo haboneka inyongera z\u2019ubutare muri farumasi, gusa hari ibyo kurya bishobora kugufasha guhorana urugero rw\u2019ubutare ruri hejuru, aya mafunguro atandukanye yaba akomoka ku bimera cg inyamaswa afasha umubiri kuko arimo ubutare buhagije. Kuyarya kenshi bizagufasha guhorana urugero rwa ngombwa ry\u2019ubutare.\nAkamaro k\u2019ubutare.\nUbutare bwitabazwa mu gukora insoro zitukura z\u2019amaraso, bukaba kimwe mu bizigize. Bugize kandi hemoglobin y\u2019amaraso, ibi bituma bugira uruhare mu gutwara umwuka mwiza wa oxygen buwuvana mu bihaha kugera mu bice byose by\u2019umubiri.\nBugira uruhare runini mu mikorere y\u2019umubiri, kuko udafite ubutare umubiri ntiwabasha guhindura isukari imbaraga umubiri ukoresha, bityo ni ingenzi cyane mu guha umubiri ingufu.\nBukora enzymes, zifasha mu mikorere itandukanye mu mubiri imbere. Izi enzymes zifasha mu gukora uturemangingo dushya, ikwirakwiza ry\u2019amakuru ku bwonko, imisemburo n\u2019aside amino (izi nizo zigize poroteyine)\nUbutare burinda uturemangingo uburozi butandukanye. Kuko bwifitemo ubushobozi bwo kurwanya uburozi mu mubiri, bufasha mu kurinda ibibazo bitandukanye byerekeye gusaza n\u2019ibindi bishobora guterwa na stress.\nBufasha mu kubaka ubwirinzi bw\u2019umubiri bukomeye no kongera ubudahangarwa\nIngaruka zo kubura ubutare\nIngaruka ya mbere ni indwara izwi nka anemia, indwara yo kubura amaraso. Irangwa n\u2019ikizungera no kutareba neza cyane cyane iyo hari izuba ryinshi.\nUko igabanuka bitera kubura umwuka wa oxygen uhagije mu mubiri, birangwa n\u2019umunaniro udasanzwe, guhondobera, kuremera umutwe n\u2019imikorere mibi y\u2019ubwonko\nIbi ahanini bituruka ku kutarya ibikungahaye ku butare, kuba unyaragura cyane, kubira ibyuya byinshi no kuva amaraso menshi.\nKu mwana muto n\u2019umugore utwite bakenera bwinshi by\u2019umwihariko kugirango bagire ubuzima buzira umuze. Kenshi kwa muganga baha umugore utwite inyongera z\u2019ubutare.\nIngaruka zo kugira ubutare bwinshi.\nUbusanzwe ntabwo bujya buba bwinshi mu mubiri kuko iyo burenze busohoka binyuze mu byuya n\u2019inkari. Hari abagira uburwayi buvukanwa bwo kutabasha gusohora ubudakenewe bityo bakagira ikibazo cyo kugira bwinshi. Icyo gihe hitabazwa muganga agatera umurwayi imiti yabigenewe.\nUsibye mu gihe wabibwiwe na muganga, si byiza gufata inyongera z\u2019ubutare zigaragara nk\u2019ibinini, igihe ufashe urugero ruri hejuru bishobora guteza ibibazo bitandukanye mu mubiri harimo n\u2019ibikomeye cyane nko kwangirika k\u2019umwijima, amaraso kugenda gahoro cyane n\u2019urupfu.\nSi ngombwa kenshi gufata izi nyongera, kuko hari ibyo kurya bushobora kubonekamo\nAho wasanga ubutare.\nBuri mu byiciro 2; ubwitwa heme nu butari heme (non-heme). Ubutare bwa heme buturuka ku nyamaswa, umubiri uhita ubwinjiza byoroshye bitandukanye n\u2019ubutari heme kuko bwo, bigora umubiri kubwinjiza ngo bukoreshwe.\nIbiryo wasangamo ubutare bwa heme.\nInyama zitukura\nIngurube\nInkoko\nInyama z\u2019umwijima\nInyama z\u2019intama\nAmagi\nAmafi\nIbiryo wasangamo ubutare butari heme.\nMu bishyimbo. Kuri ubu ibishyimbo bikungahaye ku butare biraboneka hose\nAmashaza yumye\nImbuto za sesame\nImbuto z\u2019ibihaza\nIbigori kimwe nibindi binyampeke nk\u2019ingano, uburo n\u2019amasaka\nBeterave\nImboga rwatsi\nIbyo kwitondera.\nAbantu bakora siporo ituma babira ibyuya byinshi, abantu bakuyemo inda, babyaye se, cyangwa batakaje amaraso menshi mu gihe gito, baba bakeneye ubutare bwinshi by\u2019umwihariko abagore batwite bo banahabwa inyongera yabwo kugira babungabunge ubuzima bwabo n\u2019ubw\u2019abo batwite."}
{"id": "14645", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14645", "title": "Tisane", "text": "Tisane ni icyo kunywa twakita icyayi gusa yo ikagira umwihariko wuko nta caffeine wayisangamo kuko nta majyani aba arimo. Ni icyo kunywa ushobora gutegura mu buryo bunyuranye bitewe nicyo wifuza.\nUko itegurwa.\nMu gutegura tisane wifashisha ibyo twakita nk\u2019ibirungo binyuranye. Hariho n\u2019ibigurwa butunganyije gusa ibyiza ni ibyo witeguriye. Muri byo ibyo tugiye kuvugaho by\u2019ingenzi wabona bitakugoye ni:\nUvanga bitewe nicyo wifuza kugeraho. Ucanira amazi akabira nuko ugashyiramo kimwe cyangwa byinshi mu byo twavuze ruguru. Ushobora kubikoresha bibisi cyangwa ugakoresha ifu yabyo ikorwa ubivunga umaze kubyanika ku zuba. Ya mazi rero urayayungurura ukanywa bigishyushye. Ubishatse ushyiramo isukari cyangwa ubuki."}
{"id": "14646", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14646", "title": "Ihungabana", "text": "Ubu bushakashatsi bwagaragaje ko mu bimenyetso by\u2019ihungabana, aba bantu bakunda kugaragaza harimo agahinda kenshi gakunda kugendana n\u2019ibimenyetso byo gushaka kwiyahura, kumva umuntu yataye agaciro muri we.\nTumenye igihe haba habayeho Ihungabana.\nIhungabana ni ikibazo gihangayikisha uwo ryabayeho kimwe n\u2019abamuzengurutse. Rikaba rifata umuntu nyuma yo guhura n\u2019ibintu bibi cyane ku buryo birenga ubwenge bwe kubyakira no kubyihanganira. Akenshi rikunze gufata umuntu nyuma y\u2019akarengane gakabije, gutotezwa, gukorerwa iyicarubozo, gufatwa ku ngufu, kwicirwa umuryango, kurokoka impanuka idasanzwe, n\u2019ibindi.Uburyo abantu bahangana n\u2019ihungabana buratandukanye, kuko no mu buzima busanzwe uko twakira ibitubayeho biranyuranye. Gusa nanone ni ikibazo gikosorwa kigashira nubwo kuri bamwe cyongera kikagaruka cyane cyane iyo bagize umwanya wo kwibuka ibyababayeho.Hari ibimenyetso bitandukanye by\u2019ihungabana; bimwe biba ku bantu ako kanya ikibazo kikimara kuba ibindi bikaza nyuma ya bya bihe bibi ndetse na nyuma y\u2019imyaka bibaye.Nubwo bitaba bimwe ku bantu bose, ariko muri rusange ibimenyetso ni Kwiheba no kwigunga, agahinda n\u2019umujinya bidasanzwe kandi biza vuba,Kunanirwa gusinzira no kugira icyo ukora,Gukomeza gutekereza ku byabaye bigatuma usa n\u2019uri kubibona biba ako kanya.Aha benshi bamera nk\u2019abari mu nzozi, ndetse agakora ibimenyetso byerekana ko hari ikintu kiri kumubaho. Niba wenda ari nk\u2019impanuka yabaye ugasanga ari kwipfuka mu mutwe nk\u2019aho hari ikigiye kumugwaho, niba yarafashwe ku ngufu ugasanga ari gusaza imigeri nk\u2019uri kwiyama umuntu gutyo gutyo.\nIbindi bimeyetso k'Umuntu ufite Ihungabana.\nTwibutse ko ihungabana ritagera gusa ku wahuye n\u2019ibyateye iryo hungabana ahubwo rishobora no kugera ku wabibwiwe nk\u2019inkuru nuko yagerageza kwishyira muri iyo si byaberagamo nawe akagerwaho n\u2019ihungabana. Umwana umenye ko nyina yafashwe ku ngufu, cyangwa se ko umubyeyi we yishwe atemaguwe, ashobora guhungabana nubwo byaba byarabaye adahari.Kuribwa umutwe,Kuribwa mu nda, kwituma impatwe cyangwa impiswi,Umunaniro udasanzwe,Kubira ibyuya no guteragura k\u2019umutima.Umuntu ugaragaza ibi bimenyetso aba yagezweho n\u2019ihungabana kandi aba akeneye kwitabwaho.Gusa ku bantu benshi ibi ntibimara igihe kinini. Nyamara nanone ku bandi usanga bitinda ndetse bamwe bagatangira kwiyahuza inzoga n\u2019ibindi biyobyabwenge bibwira ko ahari ari bwo bari butuze, nyamara iyo bibashizemo barongera bagasubira uko bari bameze batarabinywa nuko aho gucyemura ikibazo ahubwo kikiyongera.Icyakora nanone nubwo bamwe bagaragaza ibimenyetso byoroshye ndetse ugasanga kubaba hafi no kubaganiriza bibafasha kubisohokamo vuba, hari abandi usanga byafashe indi ntera bagakenera kwitabwaho birenze.\nUburyo wahangana ni Ihungabana.\nHari uburyo bunyuranye bushobora kwifashishwa mu gufasha uwahuye n\u2019ihungabana ndetse nawe ubwe ashobora kubukoresha akaba yakibonera igisubizo atiriwe yitabaza abandi.Mu gihe wahuye n\u2019ihungabana utakaza icyizere cy\u2019ejo hazaza kuko uba ubona ntacyo wasigariye. Ushobora kumva wanze ubuzima ndetse kubaho ntacyo bikumariye. Gusa abaganga, inshuti n\u2019umuryango nibo ba mbere bazagufasha kwigaruramo icyizere no guhangana n\u2019iryo hungabana. Nyamara mbere yuko ugendera ku byo bakubwira, ni wowe ubwawe ugomba kwifatira umwanzuro. Ni byiza ko umwanzuro ureba ubuzima bwawe ugira uruhare mu ifatwa ryawo.Gerageza uganirize umuntu wizeye kandi uha agaciro ibyakubayeho. Ni byiza ko aba umuntu ushobora kugufasha kuko uko akumva anakuganiriza ni bumwe mu buryo buzagufasha kumva uruhutse. Ntakwiye kuba wa muntu uguca intege cyangwa ukwereka ko ibyawe byoroshye. Ntuzaganyire wa muntu uzahita akubwira ati: \u201cnibe nawe, jyewe reka nkubwire ibyanjye\u201d, \u201creka ndumva ibyo bidakanganye da\u201d, n\u2019ibindi kuko aho gutuma ukira ahubwo warushaho kuremba.Rimwe na rimwe usanga uwahuye n\u2019ihungabana nta muntu n\u2019umwe aba afitiye icyizere. Ariko uko ugenda wubaka umubano n\u2019abantu banyuranye bizarushaho kugufasha guhangana n\u2019irungu bityo bigufashe kudaheranwa n\u2019ihungabana. Shaka inshuti muzahuza kandi muzarambana, inshuti muzabana ubuzima bwose, mugasangira akabisi n\u2019agahiye. Uko ugenda wongera ubusabane nabo niko bizagufasha kurushaho kumva ko utari wenyine kandi uryoherwe n\u2019ubuzima buzaza. Ibi nibyo bizatuma utumva ko isi yarangiye cyangwa urumuri rwazimye."}
{"id": "14647", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14647", "title": "Umucyayicyayi", "text": "Umucyayicyayi(Lemon Grass) cg Citronelle, ni kimwe mu birungo by'icyayi\nbifitiye akamaro kanini umubiri wacu\nbitewe ahanini n'uko tuwusangamo byinshi nka: vitamin A, B1, B2, B3, B5, B6, B9 na vitamin C. Urimo kandi imyunyu ngugu nka:\npotassium, calcium, magnesium, ubutare, umuringa na zinc.\nAkamaro kawo kumubiri.\nUsibye vitamine nyinshi twabonye\nharuguru, umucyayicyayi\nwifitemo ingufu zo kurwanya ibinure no kugabanya igipimo cya cholesterol mbi mu mubiri.\nUfasha mu kurinda indwara z\u2019umutima ziterwa na cholesterol nyinshi.\nUmucyayicyayi kandi wifashishwa mu kurinda mikorobi. Ukoreshwa mu kuvura ibimeme, ibifaranga, ibihushi n\u2019izindi ndwara zose ziterwa n\u2019imiyege. Umucyayicyayi ukoreshwa cyane mu buvuzi buzwi nka Ayurvedic mu kuvura ibicurane n'inkorora.\nWifashishwa mu kurwanya ibimenyetso bya asima.\nKuwunywa mu cyayi bifasha gusinzira neza. Ufasha mu kurwanya ibisebe mu gifu, guhitwa, isesemi no kubabara mu nda.Ukorwamo kandi n'umubavu ufasha abantu mu kwirukana amasazi, imibu n\u2019utundi dukoko,\nNi byinshi cyane twavuga gusa reka tuvuge muri macye ibindi ufashamo"}
{"id": "14648", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14648", "title": "Urwuri", "text": "Urwuri cyangwa igikuyu cyangwa igisambu ni umurima munini cyangwa mutoya uzitiye cyangwa utazitiye ariko wagenewe kuragirwamo n'amatungo buruyro bwose, harimo ibyatsi cyangwa ibiti birirwa n'amatungo nka sitariya, urubingo, urwiri, kimari terebusakumu."}
{"id": "14649", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14649", "title": "Urwiri", "text": "Urwiri ni ikimera kimera mu butaka, cyo ubwacyo kirimeza cyifitemo amoko mesnhi bitewe nakarere kirimo, ubutaka kiriho, ifumbire gikoresha, ubwoko bw'urwiri. urwiri nubwo rutakirwa neza n'abahinzi ariko rufite umumaro ukomeye kuko rufite irwara zidandukanye ruvura kuko imizi yurwiri ubwayo ivura ndetse nu rwiri rukavura. \numumaro.\nUrwiri Ni ruvura ubushye. Twovuga:\nkubafise indwara za"}
{"id": "14650", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14650", "title": "Umukomamanga", "text": "Umukomamanga ni ikimera cyikagira ubwoko bw'inshi bw'ibiti bigikomokaho, Ni ubwoko bw'ibiti bikunda kuba mu b\"ibihuru ndetse ni n'ibiti bifite umuryango bihuriye wa Rosaceyae, Umukomamanga wagiye ukomoka mu turere dushyuha two muri Afurika y'Amajyaruguru, mu majyaruguru y'isi mu Burayi, Aziya, na Amerika y'Amajyaruguru. Umukomamanga ni umuti w'irwara zigiye zitandukanye."}
{"id": "14651", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14651", "title": "Pale chanting goshawk", "text": "Pale chanring Goshawk.\nni inyoni ihiga mu muryango wa Accipitridae,ni inyoni yororoka mu majyepfo\ny'africa, iyinyoni ni 75cm, ni inyoni ikunda kugaragara hafi y'abantu.\nubu bwoko bugera kuri cm 55 z'uburebure hamwe n'amababa ya cm110,\nni inyoni ifite umweru wijimye ujya gusa n'imvi,ikagira igihanga,amaso\ny'umukara,umurizo w'irabura,n'amaguru asa umuhondo."}
{"id": "14652", "revid": "10821", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14652", "title": "Icyo wamenya kuru Gabar", "text": "Gabar.\nGabar Goshawk ni imwe mu bwoko buto bw'inyoni yo muri africa n'abarabu.\nzituruka mu muryango wa Accipitridae.\nGabar ni mwe mu nyoni zitanganje kandi ziboneka muburyo buburi butandukanye,\nbuhindagurika mu bwinshi ugereranije bw'imiterere y'ubu bwoko, imiterere ikunze \nkugaragara ifite ibara ry'ikigina hamwe n'umurizo muremure kandi wijimye,ubwoko\nbw'amaguru ni umuhondo, ikagira inzara ndende kandi zijimye."}
{"id": "14653", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14653", "title": "African Goshawk", "text": "African.\nAfrican Goshawk ni ubwoko bw'inyoni zituruka mu bwoko bwa Accipiter mu bwoko bw'umuryango \nwa Accipitridae.\niyi nyoni bakunze kwita inyoni nya afrika ifite amaso y'ijimwe impeta y'umuhondo\nikagira igihanga gisa n'imvi,amababa y\"ijimye n'umurizo muremure w'umukara\nikagira agatuza kera n'amaguru maremare y'umuhondo ninzara zatuye zirabura.\ningore zipima (270-510 G (9.5-18.0 oZ).\nmugihe ingabo zazo zipima (150-340 g (3.5-12.oZ) Amababa yikubye inshuro\n1.7 uburebure bw'inyoni hamwe (440-570MM (17.2-22-5 In)\ningabo ni (540-700MM (21.1-27.5 In) Mu ngore."}
{"id": "14654", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14654", "title": "Musafiri Ildephonse", "text": "Musafiri Ildephonse ni Minisitiri w\u2019Ubuhinzi n\u2019Ubworozi muri guverinoma yu Rwanda. \nIbyo yakoze.\nMinisitiri Musafiri Ildephonse yari asanzwe ari Umunyamabanga wa Leta muri Minisiteri y\u2019Ubuhinzi n\u2019Ubworozi guhera muri Kanama 2022. Dr Ildephonse Musafiri yabaye kandi umuyobozi w\u2019akanama gashinzwe ingamba na politiki za leta mu biro bya Perezida. Dr Ildephonse Musafiri ni umwe mu bagize inama y\u2019ubutegetsi ya Banki Nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, akaba umwalimu muri Kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, Ishami ry\u2019ubukungu n\u2019ubucuruzi, ndetse akaba umuyobozi w\u2019agashami k\u2019ubukungu. Dr Ildephonse Musafiri yakoze ubushakashatsi ku iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu na politiki za leta by\u2019umwihariko ubusesenguzi kuri gahunda zo kurandura ubukene n\u2019ubusumbane, iterambere ry\u2019ubuhinzi n\u2019ibiribwa.\nIbyo yize.\nDr Ildephonse Musafiri Ni umugabo wize icyiciro cya gatatu cya Kaminuza yacyize muri Kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda. Afite impamyabumenyi y\u2019ikirenga mu bukungu bushingiye ku buhinzi yakuye muri Kaminuza ya Bonn mu Budage."}
{"id": "14655", "revid": "10821", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14655", "title": "Red necked falcon", "text": "Red necked falcon.\nni inyoni ikomoka mu muryango wa ba Falcon ifite nenzi zazo ziitandukanye \nimwe mu buhinde indi muri afurika. iyi nyoni ya falcon ifite amababa yijimye\nku mubiri wo hejuru, igihanga gisa orange,umunwa wa orange ikagira \numurizo muremure wijimye w'umukara, ikagira amaguru maremare \ny'umuhondo,inzara zatuye z'umukara.\nikunda gutorera mu bihuru, ibishanga cyangwase ku mazi maremare\nigaburirwa na amphibia, amafi, iminyorogoto n'utundi tunyabuzima duto. "}
{"id": "14656", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14656", "title": "Ndabamenye Telesphore", "text": "Ndabamenya Telesphore ni umugabo akaba Umuyobozi Mukuru wa RAB, Ikigo cy'Igihugu gishinzwe Ubuhinzi n'Ubworozi mu Rwanda, kibarizwa muri Minisiteri y'ubuhinzi n'ubworozi. Docterur Ndabamenya Telesphore mbere yari asanzwe ari Umujyanama muri Minisiteri y\u2019Ubuhinzi n\u2019Ubworozi. Dr Ndabamenya Telesphore Mbere yaho yabaye Umuyobozi ushinzwe umusaruro w\u2019ubuhinzi no kwihaza mu biribwa muri RAB, Ikigo cy'Igihugu gishinzwe Ubuhinzi n'Ubworozi mu Rwanda. "}
{"id": "14657", "revid": "15375", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14657", "title": "African Hobby", "text": "African Hobby.\nNi akanyoni gafata koroheje gafite ibara ryirabura hamwe nu duce twimbitse twa rufous\numusaya utuje kandi ugororotse hafi y'umuhogo n'umukara ugaragara k'umuhogo \nndetse n'impande zawo, uruhu rwo kumaso n'ibirenge n'umuhondo, izikagira\nuburebure bwa 7.5in amababa (70 Cm-(28 in) \nziboneka cyane cyane ku nkombe z'ishyambe ahantu hatose bikunze kugaragara \nmu mashyamba ya palm savannah no mu turere tw'iburasirazuba bwa Africa \ny'iburasirazuba nti bukunze kugaragara muri Africa yo hagati no mu majyaruguru\ny'iburasirazuba bwa Africa. \nzikunda ku gaburirwa n'udukoko tuguruka, inzige, inyenzi,na cicadas. \nAmashakiro;"}
{"id": "14658", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14658", "title": "Peregrine falcon", "text": "Peregrine.\nPeregrine Falcon izwi kw'izina rya peregrini, kandi ikaba ifite amateka mu bwoko\nbwa Daki, muri amerika ya ruguru, ni inyoni y'inyamanswa ihiga mu muryango\nwa Falconidae peregrini ifite umuvuduko ugera kuri 320Km/H (200)mph bikaba \naribyo biyigira inyoni yihuta mu mateka y'isi, ndetse n'umunyamuryango wihuta \nmu bwami bw'inyamanswa, ishobora kuboneka kw'isi yose usibye uturere tumwe\nna tumwe. imisozi miremire cyane n'amashyamba y'imvura nyinshi, imwe mu bwoko\nbw'inyoni buboneka cyane, abahanga bamenya amoko agera kuri 17 kugera kuri 19 "}
{"id": "14659", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14659", "title": "RAB", "text": "Ikigo gishinzwe guteza imbere ubuhinzi n\u2019ubworozi mu Rwanda. RAB (Rwanda Agriculture Board) ni urwego rwigenga rwashyizweho n\u2019ITEGEKO N \u00b0 14/2017 RYA 14/04/2017. Itegeko risobanura ko RAB ifite intego rusange yo guharanira iterambere ry\u2019ubuhinzi mu bumenyi bushingiye; ikoranabuhanga ritwarwa n\u2019inganda zishingiye ku isoko, ukoresheje uburyo bugezweho mu bihingwa, inyamaswa, uburobyi, amashyamba n\u2019ubutaka n\u2019amazi mu biribwa, fibre n\u2019ibicanwa bitanga umusaruro no gutunganya. \nIbigo Byahujwe.\nGuverinoma y'u Rwanda iteganya ko iri vugurura rikuraho umurage w'amateka wateje icyuho cy\u2019ubukorikori hagati y\u2019ubushakashatsi no kwagura, gushimangira isano na politiki, no gushyiraho uburyo bunoze bwo gutanga serivisi binyuze mu nzego zinjira mu nzego z\u2019ubuhinzi hagamijwe kuzamura imibereho y\u2019abaturage b\u2019u Rwanda. RAB yashinzwe mu bigo bitatu by\u2019ubuhinzi, aribyo:"}
{"id": "14661", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14661", "title": "Lanner falcon", "text": "Lanner falcon.\nnimwe munyoni y'inyamaswa yororoka muri Africa, no mu majyepfo y'uburasirazuba \nbw'uburayi no muri aziya, ihitamo kuba ahantu hafunguye kandi hanini\nfalconi ihiga inyoni ngenzi zayo n'utundi tunyabuzima dutandukanye.\nFalcon Lanner yasobanuwe n'umuhanga mu binyabuzima w'umuhorandi,Jacob Temminck.\nryitwa Falcon Biarmicus, umuhanga mu binyabuzima wo muri suwede Carl Linnaeus "}
{"id": "14662", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14662", "title": "Kestrel", "text": "Kestrel.\nKestrel ni izina risanzwe rihabwa amoko menshi y'inyoni ziva mu bwoko \nbwa Falcon, Kestrel itandukanyijywe byoroshye, imyitwarire isanzwe \nyo guhiga igomba kugenderwa mu burebure bwa (10-20 Metre(35 tf 65)\nubwoko bwinshi bwitwa Kestrel bugaragara nk'ibice bitandukanye muri\nlauchete, nkuko byagaragajwe. ibi bisa nkaho bitandukanyijwe nizindi falcon "}
{"id": "14664", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14664", "title": "Umurenge wa Bugeshi", "text": "Umurenge wa Bugeshi ni umwe mu mirenge 12 igize Akarere ka Rubavu, mu Intara y'Uburengerazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAbaturage.\nUmurenge wa Bugeshi ufite ubuso bwa kilometero kare 31,05. Ibarura rusange ry\u2019abaturage ryo mu 2022 ryagaragaje ko wari utuwe n\u2019abaturage 33.892, barimo abagore 17.636 n\u2019abagabo 16.256. Ubucucike bw\u2019abaturage bwari abantu 1.092 kuri kilometero kare.\nMu baturage bose, 12.786 bari bafite imyaka iri munsi ya 15, abagera kuri 19.885 bari hagati y\u2019imyaka 15 na 64, naho 1.221 bari bafite imyaka 65 cyangwa irenga. Abaturage 29.599 bari batuye mu cyaro, mu gihe 4.293 bari batuye mu mijyi.\nIbikorwa remezo.\nMu 2017, abaturage ba Bugeshi biyubakiye ibiro bishya by\u2019umurenge bifite agaciro ka miliyoni 196 z\u2019amafaranga y\u2019u Rwanda. Akarere ka Rubavu katanze miliyoni 70, andi mafaranga atangwa n\u2019abaturage, banagize uruhare mu mirimo yo kubaka binyuze mu muganda.\nMuri uwo mwaka, Umurenge wa Bugeshi wabaye uwa kabiri mu Rwanda mu bikorwa by\u2019umuganda."}
