{"id": "14667", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14667", "title": "Minisiteri y\u2019Ubuhinzi n\u2019Ubworozi", "text": "Minisiteri y'Ubuhinzi n'Ubworozi (\"Ministry of Agriculture and Animal Resources\", MINAGRI) ni minisiteri ya Leta y'u Rwanda. Ishinzwe guteza imbere ubuhinzi n'ubworozi.\nIntego yayo ni ukugira ngo u Rwanda rugire umutekano w'ibiribwa. Kuva mu Ukuboza 2025, Minisitiri w'Ubuhinzi n'Ubworozi ni Telesphore Ndabamenye.\nInshingano.\nInshingano ya MINAGRI ni uguteza imbere ubuhinzi n'ubworozi bigezweho kandi birambye. Ubwo buhinzi bugomba gutanga umusaruro mwinshi no guhangana ku isoko. Bugomba gufasha mu bintu bitatu:\nIcyerekezo cya MINAGRI gishingiye kuri Politiki y'Igihugu y'Ubuhinzi yo mu 2018. Icyo cyerekezo ni u Rwanda rufite umutekano w'ibiribwa, imirire myiza, n'ubuhinzi butera imbere mu buryo burambye. MINAGRI ishyira mu bikorwa iyo politiki binyuze muri Gahunda y'Ingamba yo Kuvugurura Ubuhinzi (PSTA5).\nMINAGRI ifite ibigo bibiri bishyira mu bikorwa politiki zayo:\nAbaminisitiri.\nG\u00e9rardine Mukeshimana yayoboye MINAGRI kuva mu 2014 kugeza muri Werurwe 2023. Ku wa 2 Werurwe 2023, Ildephonse Musafiri yamusimbuye. Mbere yaho, Musafiri yari Minisitiri wa Leta muri iyi minisiteri.\nKu wa 18 Ukwakira 2024, Mark Cyubahiro Bagabe yasimbuye Musafiri. Bagabe yari yarayoboye RAB inshuro ebyiri.\nKu wa 1 Ukuboza 2025, Telesphore Ndabamenye yasimbuye Bagabe. Mbere yaho, Ndabamenye yari Minisitiri wa Leta muri MINAGRI. Uwo munsi, Solange Uwituze yagizwe Minisitiri wa Leta."}
{"id": "14669", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14669", "title": "TWIGIRE MUHINZI", "text": "TWIGIRE MUHINZI Ni uburyo bushya bw\u2019iyamamazabuhinzi umuhinzi abigizemo uruhare. Ubu buryo ni umwimerere w\u2019igihugu, cyu Rwanda (bwashyizweho na Leta y\u2019u Rwanda), bugamije kwegereza servisi z\u2019iyamamazabuhinzi ku bahinzi bose mu Rwanda. Ni uburyo bw\u2019iyamamazabuhinzi ryegerejwe abahinzi, bushyirwa mu bikorwa n\u2019ibigo/inzego zitandukanye muri gahunda y'ubuhinzi n'ubworozi. "}
{"id": "14670", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14670", "title": "Igisusa", "text": "Ibisusa ni kimwe mu mboga nziza umubiri wa muntu ukenera kuko bikungahayemo vitamine zitandukanye \u00a0akaba ari nabyo byeraho ibihaza.\u00a0 \u00a0Ibisusa ni amababi y\u2019uruyuzi rweraho ibihaza cyangwa se imyungu, bikaba bizana indabyo z\u2019umuhondo zitwa udututu natwo turibwa. Mu bihe byo hambere, udututu batuvangaga n\u2019ubundi bwoko butandukanye bw\u2019imboga bakabigereka ku bishyimbo. mu muco wokurya ubunnyano."}
{"id": "14671", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14671", "title": "Umuzibaziba", "text": "Umuzibaziba ni igiti kikaba igiti cyangwa Ikimera kivura ibintu bitandukanye nko kuribwa munda cyane mugihe cy'imihango. Imizi, igiti, igishishwa cyangwa ikivuvu cy'Umuzibaziba biravura, yewe amababi cyangwa imbuto byose by'Umuzibaziba ni umuti uvura. guteka Umuzibaziba mu mazi ukabinnya ni umuti uvura kutagira ububabare mugihe cy'imihango, imitezi no kuviramo imbere munda. Umuzibaziba uvura na maraliya. Umuzibaziba uvura ibisebe by'imifunzo ndetse nibindi."}
{"id": "14672", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14672", "title": "Igishikashike", "text": "Igishikashike cyangwa Ishikashike ni kimwe mu bimera gifasha mu buvuzi bwa kera, Igishikashike kiravura uhereye ku mizi, igiti amashami cyangwa amababi. Igishikashike bivura irwara zu ruhu n'irwara za maso, Igishikashikekivura ibimeme, kandi kivura irwara y'umwijima, gikora kandi mu kwicyingira maraliya ndetse no kuvura inzoka zo munda ndetse nububabare byazana haba ku gifu namara."}
{"id": "14673", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14673", "title": "Umurenge wa Busanze", "text": "Umurenge wa Busanze ni umwe mu mirenge 14 igize Akarere ka Nyaruguru, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Busanze wari utuwe n'abaturage 29 795.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAbaturage.\nUmurenge wa Busanze ni umwe mu mirenge 14 y'Akarere ka Nyaruguru.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Busanze wari utuwe n'abaturage 27 190. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 29 795. Abagabo bari 14 369. Abagore bari 15 426.\nMu 2022, abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro."}
