{"id": "14677", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14677", "title": "Umurenge wa Mata", "text": "Umurenge wa Mata ni umwe mu mirenge 14 igize Akarere ka Nyaruguru, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Mata wari utuwe n'abaturage 16 117. Uruganda rw'icyayi rwa Mata ruri i Mata.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAbaturage.\nUmurenge wa Mata ni umwe mu mirenge 14 y'Akarere ka Nyaruguru.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Mata wari utuwe n'abaturage 13 900. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 16 117. Abagabo bari 7 780. Abagore bari 8 337.\nMu 2022, abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro.\nUbukungu.\nUruganda rw'icyayi rwa Mata ruri i Mata, mu Karere ka Nyaruguru. Imirima y'icyayi y'uru ruganda ifite ubuso bwa hegitari 1 455."}
