{"id": "14680", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14680", "title": "Umurenge wa Ngoma", "text": "Umurenge wa Ngoma ni umwe mu mirenge 14 igize Akarere ka Nyaruguru, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Ngoma wari utuwe n'abaturage 24 358.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAbaturage.\nUmurenge wa Ngoma ni umwe mu mirenge 14 y'Akarere ka Nyaruguru. Akarere ka Nyaruguru kagizwe n'utugari 72 n'imidugudu 332.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Ngoma wari utuwe n'abaturage 22 950. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 24 358. Abagabo bari 11 514. Abagore bari 12 844.\nMu 2022, abaturage 9 786 bari munsi y\u2019imyaka 15. Abaturage 13 221 bari hagati y\u2019imyaka 15 na 64. Abaturage 1 351 bari bafite imyaka 65 cyangwa irenga.\nMu 2022, abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro."}
