{"id": "14684", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14684", "title": "Umurenge wa Ruramba", "text": "Umurenge wa Ruramba ni umwe mu mirenge 14 igize Akarere ka Nyaruguru, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, Umurenge wa Ruramba wari utuwe n'abaturage 18 705. Ugizwe n'utugari 5. Mu 2018, Umurenge wa Ruramba watangiye kubona amashanyarazi.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAbaturage.\nUmurenge wa Ruramba ni umwe mu mirenge 14 y'Akarere ka Nyaruguru. Umurenge wa Ruramba ugizwe n'utugari 5.\nMu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, Umurenge wa Ruramba wari utuwe n'abaturage 17 126. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 18 705. Abagabo bari 8 915. Abagore bari 9 790.\nMu 2022, abaturage bose batuye mu cyaro.\nIbikorwaremezo.\nUmurenge wa Ruramba wari umwe mu mirenge y'Akarere ka Nyaruguru itagiraga amashanyarazi. Mu 2018, Akarere ka Nyaruguru na REG batangiye kuwugezaho amashanyarazi. Ingo zirenga 800 ni zo zabanje kuyahabwa."}
