{"id": "14686", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14686", "title": "Imibare", "text": "Imibare ni ubumenyi bwiga imibare n'ingano. Yiga kandi imiterere y'ibintu, umwanya n'impinduka. Amashami yayo y'ingenzi ni ibiharuro, jewometiri, aljebure n'isesengura.\nImibare ishingiye ku bihamya. Buri teworemu (\"theorem\") igomba kwemezwa. Yemezwa hashingiwe ku mahame y'ibanze yitwa aksiyome (\"axioms\"). Imibare ikoreshwa muri fizike, mu bwubatsi, mu ubuvuzi, mu by'imari no mu ikoranabuhanga.\nImibare ya mbere yanditswe yabonetse muri Mezopotamiya no muri Misiri ya kera. Yateye imbere mu Ubugereki, mu Ubuhinde, mu isi ya Islamu no mu Burayi. Ubu yigwa ku isi hose.\nInkomoko y'izina.\nMu Ikinyarwanda, \"imibare\" ni ubwinshi bw'ijambo \"umubare\". Mu ndimi nyinshi z'i Burayi, izina ry'ubu bumenyi rikomoka mu Ikigereki. Ni \"mathematics\" mu Icyongereza, \"math\u00e9matiques\" mu Igifaransa. Ijambo ry'Ikigereki \"m\u00e1th\u0113ma\" (\u03bc\u03ac\u03b8\u03b7\u03bc\u03b1) risobanura \u00abicyigwa\u00bb cyangwa \u00abubumenyi\u00bb. Rikomoka ku nshinga \"manth\u00e1nein\", \u00abkwiga\u00bb. Ijambo ry'Ikilatini \"mathematica\" rikomoka kuri \"math\u0113matik\u1e17 t\u00e9khn\u0113\", \u00abubuhanga bw'imibare\u00bb.\nAmashami y'imibare.\nKugeza mu kinyejana cya 16, imibare yari igizwe n'ibiharuro na jewometiri. Aljebure n'isesengura byavutse mu kinyejana cya 16 n'icya 17. Uyu munsi, urutonde mpuzamahanga MSC2020 rugabanya imibare mu byiciro by'ibanze 63.\nIbiharuro n'inyigisho y'imibare.\nIbiharuro byiga ibikorwa by'ibanze: guteranya, gukuramo, gukuba no kugabanya. Inyigisho y'imibare (\"number theory\") yiga imiterere y'imibare. Ibibazo bimwe byoroshye kuvuga ariko bigoye gukemura. Urugero ni teworemu ya nyuma ya Pierre de Fermat. Fermat yayivuze mu 1637. Andrew Wiles yabonye igihamya cyayo mu 1994.\nJewometiri.\nJewometiri ni rimwe mu mashami ya kera y'imibare. Yiga imirongo, inguni, inziga n'ibindi bishushanyo. Yavutse ku byari bikenewe mu gupima ubutaka no mu bwubatsi. Ahagana mu mwaka wa 300 mbere ya Yezu Kirisitu, Euclide yanditse igitabo \"Ibice\" (\"Elements\"). Iki gitabo cyamaze imyaka igera ku 2 000 ari ishingiro ry'inyigisho z'imibare.\nMu kinyejana cya 17, Ren\u00e9 Descartes yatangije uburyo bwo kugaragaza akadomo hakoreshejwe imibare. Ubu buryo bwahuje aljebure na jewometiri. Mu kinyejana cya 19 havutse jewometiri nshya, nka topolojiya (\"topology\").\nAljebure.\nAljebure ni ubuhanga bwo gukemura ingereranyo (\"equations\"). Izina ryayo rikomoka ku ijambo ry'Icyarabu \"al-jabr\". Ryakoreshejwe na Al-Khwarizmi mu kinyejana cya 9, mu mutwe w'igitabo cye. Mu kinyejana cya 16, Fran\u00e7ois Vi\u00e8te yatangiye gukoresha inyuguti mu mwanya w'imibare itazwi.\nIsesengura.\nIsesengura (\"calculus\") ryiga impinduka n'imikorere (\"functions\"). Ryatangijwe mu kinyejana cya 17 na Isaac Newton na Gottfried Wilhelm Leibniz. Buri wese yarikoze ku giti cye. Mu kinyejana cya 18, Leonhard Euler yaryaguye cyane.\nAmateka.\nImibare yavuye ku kubara, gupima no gusobanura imiterere y'ibintu. Inyandiko za mbere z'imibare zabonetse muri Mezopotamiya no muri Misiri ya kera. Yakoreshwaga mu gusoresha, mu bucuruzi no mu bwubatsi. Abanyababiloni babaraga bashingiye kuri 60. Ni yo mpamvu isaha igizwe n'iminota 60.\nGuhera mu kinyejana cya 6 mbere ya Yezu Kirisitu, imibare yabaye ubumenyi bwihariye mu Ubugereki bwa kera. Abahanga bazwi ni Pitagora, Euclide na Arikimede. Mu Ubuhinde havutse uburyo bwo kwandika imibare bushingiye ku myanya n'icumi, harimo na zeru. Ubu buryo bwageze ku Barabu, hanyuma bugera i Burayi. Mu kinyejana cya 9 n'icya 10, abahanga bo mu isi ya Islamu bateje imbere aljebure.\nGuhera mu kinyejana cya 16, imibare yateye imbere vuba mu Burayi. Abahanga bazwi ni Vi\u00e8te, Descartes, Newton, Leibniz, Euler na Carl Friedrich Gauss. Mu kinyejana cya 20 havutse amashami mashya menshi.\nImibare mu Rwanda.\nIkigo Nyafurika cy'Ubumenyi mu Mibare (\"African Institute for Mathematical Sciences\", AIMS) gifite ishami mu Rwanda. Iryo shami ryafunguwe i Kigali ku wa 27 Kanama 2016. Ryakiriye abanyeshuri ba mbere 44 baturutse mu bihugu 10. Ku wa 3 Mata 2017, Perezida Paul Kagame yatangije icyicaro gikuru cya AIMS i Kigali. Cyari cyimuwe kivuye muri Afurika y'Epfo."}
