{"id": "14752", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14752", "title": "INATEK VC", "text": "INATEK VC (Institute of Agriculture, Technology and Education of Kibungo Volleyball Club) cyangwa INATEK Volleyball Club ni ikipe ya bagabo ya kaminuza ya INATEK mu Rwanda. INATEK VC ikina imukino ya maboko wa volleyball muri shampiyona itegurwa n'Ishyirahamwe ry'umukino wa Volleyball mu Rwanda mu bagabo, FRVB (The Rwanda Volleyball Federation). INATEK VC yatwaye ibikombe bitandukanye nkaho iherutse gutwara. "}
{"id": "14754", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14754", "title": "Shelley's francolin", "text": "Icyo wa menya kuri shelley's francolin.\nShelley's francolin ni ubwoko bw.inyoni mu muryango wa Phasianidae\nubwoko bwitirire Sir Edward Shelley, mubyara wa George Ernest shelley\nIOC 13.1 Yemeye ubwoko bukurikira.\naho iboneka.\niboneka mu mashyamba y'ibyatsi: U Rwanda, kenya, mozambique \nafrica y'epfo, tanzania,uganda, mozambique.Eswatini "}
