{"id": "14761", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14761", "title": "Impunzi z'intambara yo muri Siriya", "text": "Impunzi z\u2019intambara yo muri Siriya ni abaturage n\u2019abaturage bahora bava mu bihugu byabo bahunze mu ntambara. Abaturage ba mbere y\u2019intambara bo muri Repubulika y\u2019Abarabu ya Siriya bageraga kuri miliyoni 22 (2017), harimo n\u2019abari bahatuye bya burundu. Muri uwo mubare, Umuryango w\u2019abibumbye (UN) wagaragajeko miliyoni 13.5 (2016) aribo bimuwe n\u2019intambara, basaba ubufasha bw\u2019ikiremwamuntu. Muri bo, kuva Intambara y'abanyagihugu ya Siriya yatangira mu 2011 abantu barenga miliyoni esheshatu (2016) bavanywe mu byabo, kandi abagera kuri miliyoni eshanu (2016) bahungiye mu bindi bihugu, basaba ubuhungiro cyangwa bashyirwa mu nkambi z'impunzi z'Abanyasiriya ku isi. Bikunze kuvugwa nkakimwe mubibazo bikomeye byimpunzi mumateka.\nGahunda y\u2019impunzi no guhangana n\u2019akarere (3RP) yashyizweho muri 2015 nkurwego rwo guhuza ibikorwa harimo ibihugu bituranye usibye Isiraheli. Kugeza mu mwaka wa 2016, ibihugu bitandukanye byari byemereye UNHCR gucyura burundu impunzi 170.000 zanditswe. kuko impunzi z'Abanyasiriya zagize uruhare mu kibazo cy\u2019abimukira b\u2019i Burayi, aho UNHCR yakiriye abasaba ubuhunzi bagera kuri hafi miliyoni imwe bari mu Burayi bitarenze Kanama 2017. Turukiya nicyo gihugu kinini cyakira impunzi zanditswe, kimaze kugira impunzi zirenga miliyoni 3.7. \nKugeza mu Kuboza 2022, byibuze abantu 580.000 bivugwa ko bapfuye; hamwe na miliyoni 13 z'Abanyasiriya bavanywe mu byabo na miliyoni 6.7 z'impunzi zahatiwe guhunga Siriya. Ubutegetsi bwa Ba'athiste n\u2019inzego zishinzwe umutekano zafashe kandi zica urubozo impunzi nyinshi zatahutse, zibaburira ku gahato ndetse n\u2019iyicwa ridasanzwe. Abanyasiriya bagera kuri miliyoni 12 babaho mu bihe by\u2019ibura ry\u2019ibiribwa. Itegeko No 10 ryatowe na Bashar al-Assad mu mwaka wa 2018 ryashoboje leta kwambura imitungo Abanyasiriya n\u2019impunzi bimuwe, kandi bituma gutahuka kw\u2019impunzi bitinya ko byibasirwa n\u2019ubutegetsi. Imfashanyo zita ku bantu bimuwe mu byabo (IDP) muri Siriya n\u2019impunzi [lower-alpha 1] Siriya mu bihugu duturanye zirateganijwe ahanini binyuze muri UNHCR."}
{"id": "14762", "revid": "11899", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14762", "title": "Ikinyamakuru", "text": "Ikinyamakuru nigitabo cyigihekigezweho kirimo amakuru yanditse kubyabaye kandi akenshi byandikwa muri wino yumukara hamwe numweru.\nIbinyamakuru bishobora gukwirakwiza ibintu bitandukanye nka politiki, ubucuruzi, siporo n\u2019ubuhanzi, kandi akenshi bikubiyemo ibikoresho nkinkingi zibitekerezo, iteganyagihe, bisuzuma za serivisi zaho, obitariyeri, amatangazo y\u2019amavuko, ijambo ryambukiranya, amakarito yibyanditswe, amakarito ibisetsa, hamwe ninama kubantu."}
{"id": "14763", "revid": "11200", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14763", "title": "Umunsi wababyeyi", "text": "Umunsi w'ababyeyi ni umunsi mukuru wubaha abagore nka banyina w'umuryango cyangwa umuntu ubwe ku giti cye, ndetse n'ububyeyi, imvano y'ababyeyi, ndetse n'iibyiiz'ababyeyi bo muri sosiyete. Yizihizwa muminsi itandukanye mubice byinshi byisi, cyane cyane mumezi ya Werurwe cyangwa Gicurasi. Yuzuza ibirori bisa, yubaha abagize umuryango, nk'umunsi wa papa, umunsi w'abavandimwe, n'umunsi wa basogokuru."}
