{"id": "14842", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14842", "title": "Dolassem Dieudonne", "text": "Dieudonne Dolassem (wavutse ku ya 4 Nzeri 1979) ni umukinnyi wa jido wo muri Kameruni. Yitabiriye amarushanwa yo mu mpeshyi ya 2012 mu cyiciro cya bafite ibiro 90 atsindwa mu cyiciro cya mbere na Varlam Liparteliani. \namashakiro.\nDieudonne Dolassem muri federasiyo mpuzamahanga ya Judo\nDieudonne Dolassem kuri JudoInside.com\nDieudonne Dolassem muri Olempike.com\nDieudonne Dolassem muri Olympia\nDieudonne Dolassem muri federasiyo yimikino ya Commonwealth"}
