{"id": "14908", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14908", "title": "Antoney Kibagendi", "text": "Antoney Kibagendi umunyapolitiki wa Kisii ureba intebe y'abadepite ya Kitutu Chache.Umunyapolitike wo muri Kenya Umudepite mu Nteko ishinga amategeko ya Kitutu Chache, Intara ya Kisii.\nIbyo akora.\nAnthony Kibagendi ni we washinze ikigo cya Texas Rangers Security Company na Westwood Security Services Ltd. Umucuruzi wikubye kabiri nk'umunyapolitiki yarezwe n'umubyeyi urera abana hamwe na barumuna be bombi mu rugo rwabo mu cyaro mu ntara ya Kisii. Amaze kuva mu rwego rwo hasi kandi yinjiza amafaranga make, Kibagendi yinjiye mubucuruzi hakiri kare kugirango abone amaramuko."}
{"id": "14909", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14909", "title": "Nyakundi Japheth Mokaya", "text": "Nyakundi Japheth Mokaya yavutse mu mwaka wa 1989. Umunyapolitike wo muri Kenya. Umudepite mu Ntara ya Kitutu Chache Amajyaruguru, Intara ya Kisii.\nUko yatowe.\nNyakundi Mokaya afata umwanya w\u2019inteko ishinga amategeko ya Kitutu Chache Amajyaruguru amaze kubona amajwi 11.834. Yubile Jimmy Angwenyi na Geoffrey Asanyo wa ODM babonye amajwi 8.260 na 5.609. Ibi birerekana neza inyungu nini Ruto yagize muri Kisii kuva kera byafashwe nkigihome cya ODM.\nUbu bivuze ko Nyakundi yari yaravuze umwe mu bagize inteko ishinga amategeko igihe kirekire mu mateka ya Kenya. Ibi bibaye nkigihe Manba wa Raila Simba Arati yakomeje kuyobora abo bahanganye mumarushanwa ya gubernator ya Kisii yari yabonye Machogo amukurikirana cyane.\nYagaragaye imbere y'abamurwanyaga.\nJaphet Mokaya Nyakundi yagaragaye imbere y'abamurwanya nyuma yo kubona amajwi menshi mu gace ka Kitutu Chache y'Amajyaruguru, Intara ya Kisii.\nYahisemo kwerekana ibyiyumvo bye nyuma yo kumenyekana nkuwifuza kuyobora UDA muri ako karere.\nIcyakora, Japhet Mokaya Nyakundi yashimye abaturage be ku nkunga yabo yose, aniyemeza ko ibyo basaba ari ikimenyetso cyo guharanira uburenganzira bwabo.\nYasabye ko agiye gushyira mu bikorwa ingamba zo kugabanya amapfa acukura ibyobo byo muri ako karere kugira ngo afashe abaturage mu bikorwa byabo bitandukanye.\nJaphet Mokaya yavuze ko azashyira imbere kwagura imiyoboro y'imihanda mu karere atuyemo. Yongeyeho ko azaha amashanyarazi buri muturage kuko azabafasha mu buryo butandukanye.\nIgitekerezo cya Mokaya kigaragaza cyane ko ahangayikishijwe cyane n\u2019abaturage be kandi ko yiteguye gukora no gutegeka uko bikwiye nka Mp w\u2019akarere ka Kitutu Chache y'Amajyaruguru."}
{"id": "14910", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14910", "title": "Isaac Teitei Nortey", "text": "Isaac Teitei Nortey (wavutse 1999) ni umukinnyi wa tennis ukomoka muri Gana ufite ubwene gihugu bwa Amerika. Yari umwe mu bakinnyi bakina umukino wa tennis mu rwego rwo hejuru muri Afurika afite imyaka 15.\nUbuzima nibyo yize.\nNortey yavukiye i Accra muri Gana. Yiga Iterambere ryabantu nubushakashatsi bwumuryango. ifite icyicaro muri Amerika.\nUmwuga.\nNortey yatangiye umwuga we wo gukina umupira wamaguru mbere yo kwerekeza muri tennis afite imyaka 7. Yatangiye gukina mu ikipe ya Tennis ya Galindo ya Lakeland. Yatsinze amarushanwa atandatu. Yakinnye mu marushanwa ya Tennis ya Intercollegiate Tennis yabereye muri Mexike. \nMuri Kamena 2019 Nortey yari mu ikipe ya tennis yo muri Gana yitabira imikino ya Davis Cup Group IV i Brazzaville, muri Kongo. \nAmashakiro.\nIsaac Nortey muri Nevada."}
{"id": "14911", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14911", "title": "Ndiss Kaba Badji", "text": "Ndiss Kaba Badji (wavutse ku ya 21 Nzeri 1983) ni umukinnyi wu munya Senegal uhatanira gusimbuka birebire no gusimbuka gatatu. Niwe ufite agahigo ko muri Senegal mu gusimbuka gatatu, metero 17.07 yagezeho ubwo yatsindaga Shampiyona nyafurika 2008. yasimbutse ahantu hafite uburebure bwa metero 8.32, yabigezeho mu Kwakira 2009 i Beirut, afasha kwegukana umudari wa feza muri Jeux de la Francophonie 2009.\nUmwuga.\nBadji yegukanye umudari wa feza muri Shampiyona nyafurika ya bato mu 2001. Yaje kwitabira amarushanwa y\u2019isi y\u2019abatarengeje imyaka 2002 yabereye i Kingston, muri Jamayike. yarangirije kumwanya wa cyenda mu gusimbuka gatatu. Mu marushanwa maremare yo gusimbuka yasohotse mu cyiciro afite amanota 7.37. Yabuze icyiciro cya nyuma kuri santimetero imwe gusa. Ibyiza bye ku giti cye icyo gihe byari metero 7.83 mu gusimbuka aharehare na metero 16.30 mu gusimbuka gatatu, byombi byageze i Dakar. Nyuma icyo gihembwe yangize umwanya wa gatanu muri Shampiyona nyafurika mu gusimbuka. Yasimbutse 7.90, akoresheje amasegonda 3.6. \nMu 2003 yarangije kumwanya wa gatanu muri Universiade yegukana umudari wa feza mu mikino yabereye muri Afurika yose yabereye i Abuja. Intera ye yagezeyo - metero 7,92 - yari nziza cyane ku giticye.\nUmwuga mpuzamahanga.\nGutera imbere no kugwa.\nMu 2004 Badji yarenze kubipimo maze asimbuka metero 8 ku nshuro ya mbere, asimbuka metero 8.00 mu nama yabereye mu nzu i Gashyantare i Moscou. Muri Werurwe yitabiriye amarushanwa mpuzamahanga yo mu nzu, nubwo atageze ku mukino wa nyuma. Ariko, yifashishije ibisubizo bye m 8.00 mugihe cyo hanze. Yatsindiye umudari wa feza muri Shampiyona nyafurika muri Nyakanga, maze ku ya 1 Kanama asimbuka metero 8,20 ku butumburuke bwohejuru. Mu mikino Olempike nyuma y'ibyumweru bitatu, gusa ariko, yananiwe kugera mu cyiciro cya nyuma.\nHanyuma, mu kizamini cya IAAF kitari mu marushanwa cyakozwe muri Werurwe 2005, Badji yipimishije ibintu bitemewe na androstenedione. Kubera iyo mpamvu, yabujijwe kwitabira siporo hagati ya Kamena 2005 na Gicurasi 2007. \nagaruka.\nBadji yagarutse avuye mu bihano aza muri shampiyona mu 2007. Muri kamena muri Algiers yagiye gusimbuka uburebure bya metero 8.11. Mu mikino ya Afurika Yose yabereye mu mujyi umwe nyuma y'ukwezi kumwe yatsindiye amarushanwa yo gusimbuka inshuro eshatu, afite ibyiza bishya bya metero 16.80. Yinjiye mu marushanwa y'isi ya 2007 yabereye Osaka, aho yaje ku mwanya wa karindwi mu marushanwa yo gusimbuka. Niwe muntu wenyine wo muri Senegal wageze ku mukino wa nyuma mu mikino Olempike ya 2008. Yateganijwe kandi kwinjira mu gusimbuka gatatu, ariko ntabwo yarushanwe. \nMuri 2008 yateye imbere kurushaho. Muri Shampiyona nyafurika yarushanwe mu gusimbuka gatatu, ariko yegukana umudari wa zahabu hamwe nu mudari w'igihugu metero 17.07. Mu mikino Olempike muri Kanama yarangije ku mwanya wa gatandatu mu marushanwa maremare yo gusimbuka afite ibihe byiza bya metero 8.16. Na none yinjiye mu gusimbuka gatatu, ariko yangiza ibyo yasimbutse byose. Ku mukino wa nyuma w\u2019imikino ngororamubiri ku isi ya 2008 yarangije umwanya wa karindwi mu gusimbuka birebire nu munani mu gusimbuka gatatu. \nMu ntangiriro za 2009 hatangijwe ko Badji yahawe umudari wa zahabu n'ikinyamakuru Le Soleil. Yatorewe kandi kuba umukinnyi w\u2019umwaka n\u2019itangazamakuru rya siporo ryo muri Senegali. "}
{"id": "14912", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14912", "title": "Moussa Dembele", "text": "Moussa Demb\u00e9l\u00e9 (wavutse ku ya 30 Ukwakira 1988) ni umukinnyi ikomoka i Gu\u00e9diawaye muri Senegal urushanwa mu gusiganwa ku maguru. Yahagarariye igihugu cye mu mikino Olempike ya 2012 ariko aratsirwa nyuma yo kugwa ku mbogamizi ya 8. \nIbihe byiza yagize ni amasegonda 13.70 muri metero 110, mu Umujyi wa New York 2013 n'amasegonda 7,75 muri metero 60 i Hampton 2013.\nAmarushanwa.\n1 Ntabwo yarangije kumukino wanyuma"}
{"id": "14913", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14913", "title": "Amadou Dia Ba", "text": "El Hadj Amadou Dia B\u00e2 (yavutse ku ya 22 Nzeri 1958) ni umukinnyi ukomoka mu gihugu cya Senegali wasezeye mu marushanwa ya metero 400. Yatsindiye umudari wa feza mu mikino Olempike yo muri 1988, agira ibihe byiza amasegonda 47.23. Wari uwambere yegukana umudari umwe rukumbi wa olempike kuri Senegali. Yitabiriye imikino Olempike itatu ikurikirana mu gihugu cye kavukire, guhera mu 1984."}
{"id": "14914", "revid": "11747", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14914", "title": "Aboubakry Dia", "text": "Aboubakry Dia (yavutse ku ya 17 Mata 1967) ni umukinnyi w\u2019iruka wo muri Senegal wacyuye igihe, wamenyekanye cyane mu cyiciro cya metero 400 ().\nAzwi cyane kubera kuba yarasoje ku mwanya wa kane mu isiganwa ryo guhererekanya inkoni rya mu, ari kumwe na, Hachim Ndiaye na Ibou Faye. Iri tsinda ryashyizeho agahigo ka Senegali \nIgihe cye cyiza ku giti cye (personal best) cyari amasegonda 46.50, yashyizeho mu 1991."}
{"id": "14915", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14915", "title": "Mansour Dia", "text": "Mansour Mamadou Dia (wavutse ku ya 27 Ukuboza 1940) ni umukinnyi umusimbuzi wu munya Senegali uri mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru.\nMu mikino yo muri Afurika yo mu 1965 yegukanye umudari wa feza mu gusimbuka, hamwe numwanya wa gatatu umudali wa bronze mu gusimbuka aharehare. Mu mikino yo muri Afurika yo muri 1973 yegukanye umudari mu gusimbuka ahantu harehare, ndetse n'umudari wa zahabu mu gusimbuka gatatu. \nYarangije ku mwanya wa cumi na gatatu mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1964, nuwa munani mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1968, n'uwa gatandatu mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1972. "}
{"id": "14916", "revid": "17987", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14916", "title": "Uko uRwanda rwagabanyirijwe imipaka", "text": "= Mu ikatwa ry\u2019imipaka y\u2019u Rwanda, ubwo igice kinini cyarwo cyomekwaga ku mahanga =\nMu makuru acicikana hirya no hino mu Karere k\u2019Ibiyaga Bigari cyane cyane mu Rwanda no muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Congo, harimo ihohoterwa ry\u2019Abanye-Congo bavuga Ikinyarwanda aho bakomeje gushushubikanywa ngo basubire iwabo mu Rwanda.\nBiragoye gusobanukirwa neza iby\u2019iki kibazo udahereye ku ishyirwaho ry\u2019imipaka ubwo Abanyaburayi bigabizaga Afurika mu myaka hafi 130 ishize.\nAmateka y\u2019impitabihe ku Rwanda adutekerereza ko Ruganzu Ndoli ari we washyizeho bwa mbere imipaka igabanya u Rwanda n\u2019ibindi bihugu byo mu Burengerazuba, ahasaga mu 1510. Mu gitero Ruganzu Ndoli yagabye mu Bunyabungo, ni cyo cyashyizeho imipaka ya mbere y\u2019u Rwanda, aho yakataje aza kugera ku ruzi rugabanya Kivu y\u2019Epfo na Walikare, ku mugezi uzwi nka Rua Rwanda na magingo aya.\nKugeza ku ndunduro y\u2019ibitero byo kwagura igihugu, abami bose bateye mu Bunyabungo barimo na Rwabugili, nta n\u2019umwe wigeze arenga uwo mupaka washyizweho na Ndoli ngo ajye hakurya y\u2019urwo ruzi.\nKigeli Rwabugili yatanze u Rwanda rufite ubuso bungana na kilometero kare 168.606.\nMu nama y\u2019i Berlin ubwo Afurika yacibwagamo imipaka, Abadage, Abongereza n\u2019Ababiligi, ni bo baherereye muri Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba. Abadage bahita barema icyo bise \u201cAfurika Ndage y\u2019Iburasirazuba\u201d yari igizwe n\u2019u Rwanda, Urundi na Tanganyika.\nAbabiligi bo bafashe ibihugu byo mu Burengerazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda, naho mu Majyaruguru y\u2019u Rwanda hari Abongereza bakoronije Uganda na Kenya.\nNubwo ibihugu by\u2019i Burayi byigabanyije ibyo muri Afurika bikanashyiraho imipaka uko bibyumva kuko nta yari ihari, ibihugu byakolonije ibice bya Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba n\u2019ibyo byasigaranye ihurizo ryo kugena imiterere y\u2019imipaka yabyo.\nKu wa 14 Gicurasi 1910, ni bwo hateranye inama mu Bubiligi, igamije gukemura ikibazo cyari kimaze igihe cy\u2019Ababiligi bashakaga kongera ubutaka bw\u2019aho bahawe. Iyo nama yari irimo Ababiligi bakolonizaga Congo, Abadage bakolonizaga u Rwanda, Urundi na Tanganyika ndetse na Uganda na Kenya byakolonizwaga n\u2019Abongereza.\nNyuma y\u2019iyo nama ni bwo guhera mu 1910 kugeza mu 1912, bashyizeho imipaka igabanya u Rwanda n\u2019ibindi bihugu by\u2019ibituranyi, icyo gihe ni bwo bitwaje icyo bise imbibi karemano zirimo Ibirunga, Akanyaru, Akagera n\u2019Ikiyaga cya Kivu, nuko bakatakata ubutaka bw\u2019u Rwanda rusigara ari buto cyane.\nIgice kimwe cy\u2019ubutaka bwarwo bacyometse kuri Congo (hagiye ubuso bwa kilometero kare 124. 553) harimo Kivu y\u2019Epfo na Kivu ya Ruguru. Ikindi gice kingana na kilometero kare 17.715 cyometswe kuri Uganda.\nIbice byose u Rwanda rwatwawe byari bigize 5/6 by\u2019uko rwanganaga mbere. Kuva icyo gihe, u Rwanda rwasigaranye ubutaka buto buri ku buso bwa kilometero kare 26.338.\nAbadage bari bagabanyirije ubutaka bwa koloni zabo, ntibigeze babigiraho ikibazo cyane kuko icyo bashakaga ni ibihugu bazabasha guteza imbere mu gihe cyose bazabikoloniza.\nIyo ni yo nkomoko y\u2019Abanyarwanda batuye mu bihugu by\u2019ibituranyi bakatiweho imipaka n\u2019abakoloni bakaba bakomeje kugaraguzwa agati nk\u2019aho ubutaka babirukanaho atari gakondo yahanzwe n\u2019abakurambere babo.\nIndangamurongo.\nhttps://mobile.igihe.com/umuco/amateka/article/akagambane-mu-ikatwa-ry-imipaka-y-u-rwanda-ubwo-igice-kinini-cyarwo-cyomekwaga"}
{"id": "14917", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14917", "title": "N'Deye Binta Dia", "text": "N'D\u00e8ye Binta Dia (yavutse ku ya 8 Mata 1973) ni umukinnyi wumu nya Senegali uri mu kiruhuko cy'izabukuru wazobereye mu gusiganwa ku maguru. Yaserukiye igihugu cye mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1992 ndetse no hanze hamwe na Shampiyona y'isi ya tatu yo mu nzu.\nIbyiza bye bwite.\nHanze\nMu nzu"}
{"id": "14918", "revid": "11314", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=14918", "title": "Boubacar Diallo", "text": "Boubacar Diallo (yavutse ku ya 22 Ugushyingo 1954) ni umukinnyi wo kwirukanka muri Senegali. Yitabiriye metero 100 mu bagabo mu mikino Olempike yo mu 1980."}
